<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">RRK45.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">EBYAKOZIRWE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebyakozirwe Entumwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">EBYAKOZIRWE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Byak</para>
  <para style="mt1">EBYAKOZIRWE ENTUMWA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutemba omu iguru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luk 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kitabo ky'okubanza eki naakuhandiikiire, Teofilo, nkahandiika byona ebi Yesu yaabandize kukora n'okwegyesa, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaatwariirweho omu iguru, aherize kuragiira entumwa ezi yaatooraine, naazitumaho Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ku yaaherize kubonabonesibwa, yaabeeyoreka ahuriire, yaakihamisa obumanyiso bwingi, yaamara ebiro makumi ana naabeeyoreka, naabagambira eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk 24:49</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire ateeraine nabo, yaabeehanangiriza kutaruga omuri Yerusaalemu, ati: Kureka mutegyereze eki Isheboona yaaraganiise, eki naabagambiire; <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Yohaana akabatiza n'amaizi, kwonka imwe nimwija kubatizibwa n'Omwoyo Orikwera omu biro bikye.<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ku baabaire bateeraniire hamwe, baamubuuza bati: Mukama waitu, obu nibwo bunaku obu orikwenda kugaruriramu obugabe bwa Israeli? <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:32">Mak 13:32</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Imwe, ti kyanyu kumanya ebiro nari obunaku ebi Isheboona yaataireho kuba omu bushoboorozi bwe wenka; <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />kwonka muryaheebwa amaani, Omwoyo Orikwera ku ariheza kubaijaho, kandi muryaba baakareebi bangye omuri Yerusaalemu, n'omuri Buyudaaya yoona, n'omuri Samaria, n'okuhitsya aha muheru gw'ensi. <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaatwarwa ahaiguru nibamureeba, ekicu kyamubakingira. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ku baabaire bakihangire eiguru amaisho, We naakigyenda, reeba abashaija babiri baabeemerera haihi, bajwaire ebirikwera; <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:64">Mat 26:64</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Kush 1:7</ref>. </char></note> baabagira bati: Imwe bashaija ba Galilaaya mwe, muhangiire ki amaisho ahaiguru? Yesu ogwo owaabaihwaho akatwarwa omu iguru, nikwo arigaruka nk'oku mwamureeba naatemba omu iguru. <verse eid="ACT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Batyo baagaruka Yerusaalemu nibaruga omu kibungo kya Zeituuni, ekyabaire kiri haihi na Yerusaalemu orugyendo orutarikuzira kugyendwa ahari Sabato. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ku baahikireyo, baatemba, baaza omu kishengye kya kanyinaibiri, omu aba boona baagumire, Petero, Yohaana, Yakobo, Anderea, Filipo, Tomasi, Batolomayo, Matayo, Yakobo mwene Alifaayo, Simooni Zeloote na Yuda mwene Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Abo boona hamwe n'abakazi na Mariamu nyina wa Yesu n'abarumuna, baayezirika kuguma nibashaba n'omutima gumwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matiya okuhungurira Yuda Iskaryota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Omu biro ebyo Petero akeemerera ahagati y'ab'eishe-emwe, abaabaire bateeraine, bari nka igana na makumi abiri, yaabagira ati: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>. </char></note> B'eishe-emwe, Ebyahandiikirwe bishemereire kuhikiirizibwa ebi Omwoyo Orikwera yaarangiire omu kanwa ka Daudi ahari Yuda, owaayebembeire abaizire kukwata Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Ahabw'okuba akaba naabarirwa hamwe naitwe, yaaheebwa omugabo gw'obuheereza obu. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Mat 27:3-10</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ogwo akagura omusiri n'empiiha ezi yaahairwe ahabw'ekibi eki yaakozire; yaagwa ajuumaire, yaabaruka enda, amara ge goona gaayohoka. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Ekyo kyamanywa boona abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu, n'ahabw'ekyo omusiri ogwo gukeetwa Akeludaama omu rurimi rwabo, amakuru ngu, omusiri gw'eshagama. <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Zab 69:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba kikahandiikwa omu kitabo kya Zaaburi ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Eka ye ehindukye eitongo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Hatarigira omuntu owaarituuramu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kandi ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Obureeberezi bwe butwarwe ondiijo.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Mbwenu omu bashaija abaabaire bagyenda naitwe ebiro byona ebi Mukama waitu Yesu yaamazire naitwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />okuruga aha kubatiza kwa Yohaana okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaatwihiirweho okutwarwa omu iguru, omuri abo omwe ashemereire kuba kareebi hamwe naitwe ow'okuhamya okuzooka kwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Baatoorana babiri, Yosefu orikwetwa Barusaba, ou baayetsire Yusito, n'ondiijo Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Baashaba nibagira bati: Mukama waitu, Iwe orikumanya emitima y'abantu boona omuri aba bombi otworekyemu omwe ou waatoorana, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />atware omwanya gw'obuheereza obu n'obutumwa, obu Yuda yaarugiremu akeegyendera. <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:33">Enf 16:33</ref>. </char></note> Baabateerera enteenyu, enteenyu yaakwata Matiya; yaabarirwa hamwe n'entumwa ikumi n'emwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Omwoyo Orikwera okwija aha izooba rya Pentekoote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Eizooba rya Pentekoote obu ryahika, boona bakaba bateeraniire omu mwanya gumwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:31">Byak 4:31</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho okuhoorera kwaruga omu iguru, nk'omuyaga oku guhoorera n'amaani, kwaijuriza kimwe enju omu baabaire bashutami. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Haareebeka endimi nk'ez'omuriro, zeebaganiisemu, nizaakira ahari buri omwe omuribo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44-46">Byak 10:44-46</ref>. </char></note> Boona baijura Omwoyo Orikwera, baatandika kugamba endimi ezindi, nk'oku Omwoyo yaabahaire kuzigamba.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Omu biro ebyo omuri Yerusaalemu hakaba harimu Abayudaaya, abashaija abanyadiini abaarugire omu mahanga goona agari ahansi y'eiguru. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Omutwe muhango gw'abantu, ku baahuriire okuhoorera okwo, baateeranira hamwe bashobeirwe ahabw'okuba buri muntu akahurira entumwa nizigamba omu rurimi rw'owaabo. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Boona baatangaara nibagira bati: Beitu aba boona abarikugamba t'Abagalilaaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Mbwenu kyaruga hi itwe twena okuhurira nibagamba endimi z'owaitu ei twazaariirwe? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Haza turi Abapaazi, Abameedi, Abelamiti n'abatuura Mesopotamia, omuri Buyudaaya, omuri Kapadokia, omuri Ponto, omuri Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />omuri Furugia na Pamfulia, omuri Misri n'omu mashaza ga Libya agahereraine na Kureene, n'abagyenyi abarugire Rooma, b'Abayudaaya n'abahindukire bakataaha omu diini yaabo, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />n'Abakureete n'Abaharabu; nitubahurira nibagamba omu ndimi zaitu eby'amaani ebikozirwe Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Boona baatangaara nibabanganisa, nibabuuzana bati: Eki n'enki? <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Kwonka abandi baabashekyerera, nibagira bati: Basinzire viinyo y'omutahe.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okushoboorora ebyabaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Bwanyima Petero yaayemerera hamwe na bari ikumi n'omwe, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango naabagira ati: Imwe bashaija ba Buyudaaya 'mwe n'abari Yerusaalemu mwena, mumanye eki, kandi mutegye amatu, muhurire ebigambo byangye. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Mumanye ku aba batasinzire, nk'oku murikuteekateeka, ahakuba hati n'eshaaha ishatu za nyomushana; <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Yoel 2:28-32</ref>. </char></note> kureka eki nikyo kyaragwirwe nabi Yoeli ati:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Ruhanga akagira ati: Omu biro by'aha muheru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Ndyashuka Omwoyo wangye aha bantu boona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu baryaragura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Abatsigazi baanyu baryayorekwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">N'abagurusi baanyu baryaroota ebirooto;<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Kandi omu biro ebyo ndyashuka Omwoyo wangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">Aha bahuuku bangye n'abazaana bangye, baragure.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ndyayoreka eby'okutangaaza omu iguru ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">N'obumanyiso omu nsi ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Eshagama n'omuriro n'okucumba kw'omwika;<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Eizooba riryahinduka omwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">N'okwezi kuhindukye eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">Ekiro ekyo ekikuru ekya Mukama eky'okutangaaza kitakahikire.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Kandi omuntu weena oritakira eiziina rya Mukama aryajunwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Imwe bashaija ba Israeli 'mwe, muhurire ebigambo ebi. Yesu owa Nazareesi, omushaija ou Ruhanga yaabahamiize n'emirimo mikuru n'eby'okutangaaza n'obumanyiso, ebi yaamukoreise ahagati yaanyu, nk'oku mwabyereebeire, <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:28">Byak 4:28</ref>. </char></note> Yesu ogwo, ku yaaherize kuheebwayo nk'oku Ruhanga yaakiteekateekire, akakimanya kitakahikire, mwamubamba aha musharaba, mwamwitsa emikono y'Abanyamahanga abatategyekwa Biragiro. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kwonka Ruhanga akamuzoora, aherize kubohoororwa omu kuhururwa kw'okufa, ahabw'okuba tikurabaasize kumuhamiza kimwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Zab 16:8-11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Daudi akamugambaho ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Nkaba ndeeba Mukama omu maisho gangye obutoosha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Ahakuba atuura aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo, ngu ntanyiganyiga;<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Nikyo omutima gwangye gwashemerereirwe, n'orurimi rwangye rukeesiima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Kandi n'omubiri gwangye guryahuumura gwine amatsiko;<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ahakuba toritsiga magara gangye kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">N'obu kwakuba okureka Orikwera waawe kujunda.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Okampabura emihanda y'amagara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">Kandi oryanyijuza okushemererwa ahabw'okuba omu maisho gaawe.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:36">Byak 13:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, ka mbagambire n'obumanzi ebya tatenkuriitwe Daudi, ku yaafiire, yaaziikwa, n'ekituuro kye kiri aha owaitu n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:3">Zab 89:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Nka nabi akamanya ku Ruhanga yaamurahiriire endahiro, ku arita omwe aha baijukuru aha ngoma. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ku yaamanyire ekyo kitakabaireho, yaagamba aha kuzooka kwa Kristo, ku ataratsigirwe kuzimu, kandi n'omubiri gwe ku gutarajunzire. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yesu ogwo Ruhanga akamuzoora, itwe twena turi baakareebi baakyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />N'ahabw'ekyo, ku yaaherize kutunguurwa omukono gwa buryo gwa Ruhanga, n'okuheebwa Omwoyo Orikwera, ou Isheboona yaaraganiise, yaashuka eki, eki murikureeba, kandi eki murikuhurira. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku Daudi we ataratembire mu iguru; kwonka akeegambaho ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Mukama akagambira Mukama wangye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Shutama aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Okuhitsya obu ndigira abazigu baawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:35">Akatebe k'ebigyere byawe.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:31">Byak 5:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ab'enju ya Israeli boona bamanye buzima ngu, Yesu ogwo, ou mwabambire, Ruhanga akamuhindura Omukama kandi Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhinduka kw'abantu 3,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:30">Byak 16:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu abo ku baakihuriire, baacumitwa omu mitima, baabuuza Petero n'ezindi ntumwa bati: B'eishe-emwe, tugire tuta? <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petero yaabagarukamu ati: Mweteise, mwena mubatizibwe omu iziina rya Yesu Kristo, mubone kusaasirwa ebibi byanyu; kandi nimwija kuheebwa ekiconco ky'Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ahakuba okuraganisibwa oku n'okwanyu n'okw'abaana baanyu, n'okwa boona abari hare, omuntu weena oryetwa Mukama Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:15">Fil 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaabamanyisa ebigambo ebindi bingi, naabeehanangiriza ati: Mujunwe, murugye omu bantu b'obusingye obu obutegami. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:4">Byak 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaikiriize ekigambo kye baabatizibwa; eryo izooba haayongyerwaho abantu nk'enkumi ishatu. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Baaguma nibeezirikira okwegyesa kw'entumwa, n'okukwatanisa nazo omu kubega omugaati n'omu kushaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Abantu boona baagira obwoba; eby'okutangaaza n'obumanyiso bingi byakorwa entumwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32">Byak 4:32</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaikiriize boona bakaguma hamwe, nibakwatanisa omu bintu byabo byona; <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />nibatunda amatungo gaabo n'ebintu byabo, nibabigabira boona nk'okukyena kw'omuntu oku kwabaire kuri. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Obutoosha baaguma nibeezirika kuteeranira omuri hekalu n'omutima gumwe, kandi n'okubega omugaati omu maka gaabo; kandi nibarya eby'okurya baine okushemererwa n'emitima etaine buryarya, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:14">Byak 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:1">Byak 14:1</ref>. </char></note> nibahimbisa Ruhanga, kandi nibasiimwa abantu boona. Obutoosha Mukama yaaguma naabongyeraho abarikujunwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petero na Yohaana okutambira ekirema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Petero na Yohaana bakaba nibainamuka omuri hekalu omu shaaha ey'okushaba, niyo ya mwenda. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Kandi hakaba hariho omuntu owaazairwe aremaire ebigyere; ebiro byona bakaba bamuheeka, bamubyamya aha irembo rya hekalu eririkwetwa Erirungi, okushabiriza abarikutaaha omuri hekalu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ku yaareebire Petero na Yohaana nibataaha omuri hekalu, yaabashaba empiiha. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:9">Byak 14:9</ref>. </char></note> Petero yaamutaho amaisho, hamwe na Yohaana, yaamugira ati: Tuteho amaisho! <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Onu yaagabataho, aine amatsiko ngu baza kugira eki baamuha. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Petero yaagira ati: Efeeza n'ezaabu tinziine; kwonka eki nyine, nikyo ndikukuha. Omu iziina rya Yesu Kristo owa Nazareesi, imuka ogyende. <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Yaamukwata omukono gwa buryo, yaamwimutsya; ahonaaho ebigyere bye n'obugomba-mburi bwe byatunga amaani. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Yaabandatuka, yaayemerera, yaatandika kugyenda; yaataaha nabo omuri hekalu, naagyenda, naaguruka, naahimbisa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Abantu boona baamureeba naagyenda naahimbisa Ruhanga; <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />bamanya ku ari ogwo owaabaire atuura aha irembo erirungi rya hekalu, naashabiriza; baashoberwa munonga, batangaarira ekyo ekyamubaho. <verse eid="ACT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Ku yaabaire akwaitse Petero na Yohaana, abantu boona bairukira ahu baabaire bari omu kisasi ekirikwetwa ekya Sulemaani, nibatangaara munonga.<verse eid="ACT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okubuurira abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petero ku yaabareebire, yaabagambira ati: Imwe bashaija ba Israeli 'mwe, ahabw'enki nimutangaarira omushaija ogu? Nari nimutushamaaririra ki nk'abarikuteekateeka ngu amaani gaitu nari shi okutiina Ruhanga kwaitu nibyo byagyendesa omushaija ogu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Byak 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga owa Abrahamu, owa Isaaka, kandi owa Yakobo, niwe yaahaisize ekitiinisa omuheereza we Yesu, ou mwahaireyo mukeehakanira omu maisho ga Pilaato, obu yaabaire amaririire kumurekura. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Kwonka imwe mwayehakana Orikwera kandi Ohikiriire, mwashaba kuheebwa omwitsi; <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />kandi Mukama w'amagara mwamwita; kwonka Ruhanga yaamuzoora omu bafu; naitwe turi baakareebi ab'okukihamya. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kandi omushaija ogu, ou murikureeba, kandi ou murikumanya, ahabw'okwikiriza eiziina rya Yesu, eiziina eryo niryo ryamuha amaani; kandi okwikiriza oku Yesu aha nikwo kwamukiriza kimwe omu maisho gaanyu mwena. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:34">Luk 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:13">1 Tim 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, nimmanya ngu mukakikora omu butamanya, kandi n'abategyeki baanyu nikwo baakozire. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luk 24:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga, ebi yaaraguriire omu kanwa ka baanabi boona, ngu Kristo we aryabonabonesibwa, nikwo yaakihikiriize atyo. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Byak 2:38</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mweteise, muhindukye, ebibi byanyu biragazibwe, ebiro eby'okugaruka obusya bibone kwija okuruga ahari Mukama; <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />atume Kristo owaabateereirweho, niwe Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />ou eiguru rishemereire kwakiira, okuhitsya obunaku bw'okugaruramu ebintu byona obusya, obu Ruhanga yaabaire agambira omu kanwa ka baanabi be abarikwera abaabire bariho okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bir 18:15</ref>. </char></note> Buzima kwo Musa akagira ati: Mukama Ruhanga aryabaimukiza nabi nkaanye okuruga omuri beene waanyu; ogwo ebi aribagambira byona, mubyorobere. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:29">Lev 23:29</ref>. </char></note> Nabi ogwo, ku ariija, omuntu weena otarimworobera aryahwerekyerezibwa, aihwe omu bantu. <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Kandi na baanabi boona abaaragwire okuruga ahari Samueli n'abaamukuratiire, nabo nikwo baagambire aha biro ebi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Imwe muri batabani ba baanabi, kandi ab'endagaano ei Ruhanga yaaraganiise baashwenkuriimwe, obu yaagambira Abrahamu ati: Kandi omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omwijukuru, omu Rugriika n'embibo. Reeba Bagal. 3:16. </char></note>mwijukuru waawe nimwo enganda zoona ez'ensi ziriheerwa omugisha. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Niimwe Ruhanga yaabandize kutumaho Omugaragwa we, aherize kumuzoora, ngu abahe omugisha naabahindura, omuntu weena omuriimwe arugye omu bibi bye.<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Okukwatwa kwa Petero na Yohaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:52">Luk 22:52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibakigamba n'abantu, baayecura abanyamurwa n'omurinzi omukuru wa hekalu n'Abasadukaayo, <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />babagwereirwe kubi, ahabw'okwegyesa abantu, nibabagambira ngu omuri Yesu nimwo okuzooka omu bafu kubonekyeire. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Baabakwata, baabata omu kihome okuhitsya omu kasheeshe, ahakuba bukaba buri omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Kwonka baingi ahari abo abaahuriire ekigambo ekyo bakaikiriza; n'omubaro gw'abashaija gwayeyongyera, gwahika nk'enkumi itaano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ku bwaseesire, abategyeki baabo n'abakuru b'abantu n'abahandiiki baateeranira Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />na Aana omunyamurwa omukuru na Kayaafa na Yohaana na Alegizanda, n'abandi boona ab'omuryango gw'omunyamurwa omukuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:23">Mat 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kubeemereza ahagati, baababuuza bati: Ni bushoboorozi ki, nari n'iziina ki, ebyabakoresa eki? <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Petero, aijwire Omwoyo Orikwera, yaabagarukamu ati: Imwe abategyeki b'abantu n'abakuru, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />ku turaabe nitubuuzibwa hati ahabw'ekirungi eki tukoreire omuntu ogwo ekirema, n'ekimukirize, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />imwe mwena n'abantu boona Abaisraeli mumanye ngu omu iziina rya Yesu Kristo owa Nazareesi, ou mwabambire aha musharaba, kandi ou Ruhanga yaazoire omu bafu, ahabw'Ogwo omushaija ogu ayemereire omu maisho gaanyu akizire. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zab 118:22</ref>. </char></note> Yesu ogwo niwe ibaare imwe abombeki eri mwayangire, eryahindukire obuhamizo bw'enju. <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kandi tihariho ondiijo ou twakuboneramu okujunwa, ahakuba tihariho rindi iziina ahansi y'eiguru eryahairwe abantu, erishemereire kutujuna.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakuru okurekura entumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ku baareebire obumanzi bwa Petero na Yohaana, haza nibamanya ku bari abantu babisi abateegyesiibwe, baatangaara; bwanyima baijuka ku baabaire batuura na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kandi ku baareebire omushaija ogwo okizire ayemereire hamwe nabo, baabura oku baraabahakanise. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ku baaherize kubaragiira kushohora aheeru y'eishengyero, baahanuura bonka, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:47">Yoh 11:47</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Abashaija aba tubagire tuta? Abantu boona abatwire Yerusaalemu nibamanya ku bakozire eky'okutangaaza ekirangainwe, kandi naitwe titurikubaasa kukyehakana. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Mbwenu okukizibira kubuga omu bantu, murekye tubakangise, okuruga hati batagira omuntu ou baagaruka kugambira omu iziina eryo. <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nikwo kubeeta, bakabeehanangiriza kutagaruka kuteeza n'obu kwakuba okwegyesa omu iziina rya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Kwonka Petero na Yohaana baagarukamu, nibabagira bati: Ku kiraabe kihikire omu maisho ga Ruhanga kuhurira imwe okukira Ruhanga, naimwe mukireebe; <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />kwonka itwe titurikubaasa kuhunama kutagamba ebi twareebire, n'ebi twahuriire. <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ku baaherize kugaruka kubakangisa, baabarekura, ahabw'okuba bakabura oku baraabahane ahabw'okutiina abantu; ahakuba boona bakaba nibahimbisa Ruhanga ahabw'ekyo ekikozirwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Kandi omushaija ogwo, owaakoreirwe eky'okutangaaza ekyo eky'okukizibwa, akaba ahingwize emyaka makumi ana.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekanisa okushaba Ruhanga obumanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ku baarekwirwe, baagyenda baashanga bagyenzi baabo, baabatekyerereza byona ebi abanyamurwa abakuru n'abakuru b'abantu baabagambira. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 146:6">Zab 146:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabihuriire, baimutsya amaraka gaabo ahari Ruhanga n'omutima gumwe, nibagira bati: Mukama waitu, niiwe owaahangire eiguru n'ensi n'enyanja n'ebirimu byona; <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Zab 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref>. </char></note> kandi okagambira omu kanwa ka tatenkuriitwe Daudi, omugaragwa waawe, naagambisibwa Omwoyo Orikwera ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">N'enki ekyajagaraize Abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">N'amahanga nigateekateekyera ki ebitaine mugasho?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Abagabe b'ensi bakatenga orugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">N'abategyeki bakeeteerana hamwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">Kurwanisa Mukama na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kristo, niwe Mesia, byombi nibimanyisa Owaashukirweho amajuta. </char></note>Kristo we.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />N'eky'amazima omu rurembo oru Heroode na Pontio Pilaato hamwe n'abanyamahanga n'enganda za Israeli bakeeteerana kurwanisa Omuheereza waawe orikwera Yesu, ou waashukireho amajuta, <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Byak 2:23</ref>. </char></note> ngu bahikiirize ebi waamaririire ira omu bwengye bwawe kukora n'omukono gwawe. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:19">Efe 6:19</ref>. </char></note> Hati mbwenu, Mukama waitu, reeba okukangisa kwabo, obaasise abahuuku baawe kugamba ekigambo kyawe n'obumanzi bwona, <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />iwe ogoroire omukono gwawe kukiza, haza obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza bikorwe omu iziina ry'Omuheereza waawe orikwera Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:2">Byak 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 2:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kushaba, omwanya ogu baabaire bateeraniiremu gwatengyeta; boona baijura Omwoyo Orikwera, baagamba ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'obumanzi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obumwe bw'abaikiriize ab'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Abo boona abaikiriize bakaba baine omutima gumwe n'enaama emwe; omuribo tihariho owaabaire aine obunyakantu aha bintu bye, bakaba nibakwatirana omu bintu byabo byona. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Kandi entumwa zikagira amaani maingi g'okuhamya okuzooka kwa Mukama waitu Yesu; n'embabazi nyingi zaabagumaho boona. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:45">Byak 2:45</ref>. </char></note> Omuribo tihaine owaabaire aine eki akyenire, ahabw'okuba abaabaire baine ebibanja nari amaju bakabitunda, baareeta empiiha ezaabirugiremu, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />baazita aha bigyere by'entumwa; baazibabaganisiza nk'okwetenga kwa buri muntu oku kwabaire kuri. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:22">Byak 11:22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 11:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:4">13:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:39">15:39</ref>. </char></note> Na Yosefu, ou entumwa zaayetsire Barunaba, amakuru ngu, Omwana w'Okwezirikisa, Omuleevi enzaarwa ya Kupuro, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />akaba aine omusiri, yaagutunda, yaareeta empiiha, yaazita aha bigyere by'entumwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Anania na Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kwonka omushaija orikwetwa Anania n'omukazi we Safira baatunda ekibanja; <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />yaayetsigariza ekicweka ky'obuguzi bwakyo, n'omukazi we naakimanya, yaareeta ekyatsigaireho, yaakita aha bigyere by'entumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petero yaagira ati: Beitu Anania, ahabw'enki Sitaane aijwire omutima gwawe okubeiha Omwoyo Orikwera, okeetsigariza ekicweka ky'obuguzi bw'ekibanja? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Otakakitundize, kikaba kitari kyawe? Hoona na waaherize kukitunda, obuguzi bwakyo tiburagumire omu bushoboorozi bwawe? N'enki ekikuteekateekyeise omu mutima gwawe okukora otyo? Tobeihire bantu, obeihire Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Anania, ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, yaagwa ahansi, yaafa. Boona abaakihuriire baakwatwa obwoba bwingi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Abatsigazi baimuka, baamuzinga, baamutwara, baamuziika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ku haahingwireho omwanya gw'eshaaha nka ishatu, omukazi we yaija ataine ki arikumanya. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petero yaamubuuza ati: Ngambira; obuguzi obu nibwo mwatunzire omu kibanja? Yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, nibwo obwo. <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petero yaamugira ati: Ahabw'enki mwaikirizaine kugyeza Omwoyo wa Mukama? Hurira emitsindo y'abarikuruga kuziika baro, bari aha rwigi, naiwe bakushohoze. <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ahonaaho yaagwa ahansi aha bigyere bye, yaakinuka. Abatsigazi abo, ku baataahiremu, baashanga yaafiire, baamushohoza aheeru, baamuziika aha rubaju rwa iba. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Obwoba bwingi bwakwata ekanisa yoona, na boona abaabihuriire.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa okukora eby'okutangaaza bingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 3:11">Byak 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza bingi bikakorwa emikono y'entumwa omu bantu; kandi boona bakaba bateeranira omu kisasi kya Sulemaani n'omutima gumwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Aha bandi tihariho n'omwe owaayehangire kuteerana nabo; kwonka abantu boona bakaba babahimbisa munonga; <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />n'abaikiriize baingi, abashaija n'abakazi, baayeyongyera munonga kukanya, nibeehongyera Mukama; <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:11">Byak 19:11</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:56">Mak 6:56</ref>. </char></note> n'okutwara batwara abarwaire baabo, babarambika omu nguuto aha bitanda n'omu ngozi, ngu abamwe aharibo bakaahikwaho ekinyimanyimi kya Petero yaaba naahingura. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Kandi abantu baaruga omuri tauni eziri haihi na Yerusaalemu, baateeranira aho, bareetsire abarwaire n'abariho baadaimoni; boona baatambirwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maraika okwiha entumwa omu kihome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Bwanyima omunyamurwa omukuru yaimuka n'abo abu yaabaire aine, ab'omu kicweka ky'Abasadukaayo, baijwire eihari; <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />baakwata entumwa, baazita omu kihome zoona. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:7">Byak 12:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nyekiro, maraika wa Mukama yaigura enyigi z'ekihome, yaabashohoza aheeru, yaagira ati: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Mugyende mwemerere omuri hekalu, mugambire abantu ebigambo byona eby'Amagara aga. <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ku baakihuriire, baataaha omuri hekalu omu kasheeshe, baayegyesa. Ku baabaire bakiriyo, omunyamurwa omukuru yaija hamwe n'abo abu yaabaire aine, yaateerana eishengyero n'abakuru boona b'Abaisraeli, yaatuma omu kihome kubareeta. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Abakuru b'abaserukare ku baahikireyo, tibaabashangamu, baagaruka, baabamanyisa, bati: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Ekihome twashanga kikingirwe gye buzima, n'abarinzi beemereire aha nyigi; kwonka ku twaiguraho, titwashangamu muntu. <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Omurinzi wa hekalu n'abanyamurwa abakuru ku baahuriire ebigambo ebyo, baashoberwa munonga, baayebuuza ahu biraagarukire. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Omu mwanya ogwo haija omuntu yaabagambira ati: Reeba, abashaija abo abu mutaire omu kihome, beemereire omuri hekalu nibeegyesa abantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Omurinzi ogwo hamwe n'abakuru b'abaserukare nikwo kugyenda bakabareeta, batarikubaita kubi, ahakuba bakaba nibatiina abantu ngu batabateera amabaare.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ku baabahikize aho, baabeemereza omu maisho g'eishengyero, omunyamurwa omukuru yaababuuza ati: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27:25</ref>. </char></note> Titurabeehanangiririize kimwe kutagaruka kwegyesa omu iziina eryo? Mbwenu reeba mwijwize Yerusaalemu okwegyesa kwanyu. Nimwenda ngu eshagama y'ogwo mushaija etutukurire? <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:18">Dan 3:18</ref>. </char></note> Petero n'ezindi ntumwa baagarukamu bati: Tushemereire kworobera Ruhanga okukira abantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Ruhanga wa baatatenkuriitwe akazoora Yesu ou mwaitsire muhanikire aha muti. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:2">Heb 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo Ruhanga akamutembya, yaamuta aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo, ngu abe Omwebembezi mukuru kandi Omujuni, okuhaisa Abaisraeli okweteisa n'okusaasirwa ebibi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:26">Yoh 15:26</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Itwe turi baakareebi b'ebyo hamwe n'Omwoyo Orikwera ou Ruhanga yaahaire abarikumworobera.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuteisa kwa Gamalieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:54">Byak 7:54</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baahuriire ebyo, baakwatwa ekiniga munonga, baayenda kubaita. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Byak 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu ishengyero hakaba harimu Omufarisaayo orikwetwa Gamalieli omwegyesa w'Ebiragiro, owaabaire ari ow'ekitiinisa omu bantu boona; yaayemerera, yaaragiira kushohoza entumwa omwanya mukye. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Yaabagira ati: Imwe bashaija ba Israeli 'mwe, mwerinde; ebi murikwenda kukora aba bantu, mubigyendeho mpora. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Nimumanya ngu omu biro bihingwire, hakaimuka omushaija orikwetwa Teuda, yaayegambaho ku ari omuntu mukuru; kandi abantu nka magana ana baakwatanisa nawe; kwonka omushaija ogwo akaitwa, n'abaamukuratiire boona baataataana, baahwaho. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:2">Luk 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ogwo omu biro by'okwehandiikisa, hakaimuka Yuda owa Galilaaya, yaagomesa abantu baingi, baamukuratira; kwonka nawe yaitwa, n'abaamukuratiire boona baataataana. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:13">Mat 15:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati nimbagambira nti: Eby'aba bantu mubyetantare, mubarekye; ahakuba enaama egi nari omurimo ogu ku biraabe biri eby'abantu, biryahwerekyerera; <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:5">Byak 9:5</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku biraabe biri ebya Ruhanga, timuribaasa kubihwerekyereza; mwerinde mutakaareebeka nimurwanisa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Batyo baikiriza obwengye obu yaabaha; baayeta entumwa, baaziteera; baazeehanangiriza kutagaruka kugamba omu iziina rya Yesu, baazirekura. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:13">1 Pet 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Zityo zaaruga omu maisho g'eishengyero, nizishemererwa ahabw'okuheebwa ekitiinisa eky'okuhemurwa niziturwa eiziina rya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Kandi ebiro byona, omuri hekalu n'omu maka gaabo tibararekire kwegyesa bya Yesu n'okubuurira abantu ku ari Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abadiikoni b'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:35">Byak 4:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo abeegi ku baayeyongyeire kukanya, Abayudaaya abaarugire Bugriika baayetomboitera Abaheburaayo, ahabw'okuba abafaakazi baabo bakaba bahugirweho omu kugaburirwa kw'obutoosha. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Bari ikumi na babiri baayeta omutwe gwona ogw'abeegi, baagira bati: tikihikire itwe kurereera kugamba ekigambo kya Ruhanga ahabw'okugabura. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:8">1 Tim 3:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, mutoorane omuriimwe abashaija mushanju abarikusiimwa, abaijwire Omwoyo n'obwengye, abu turaahe omurimo ogu. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Reero itwe nitwija kwezirikira okushaba n'okuheereza ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ekigambo ekyo kyasiimwa omutwe gwona; baatoorana Stefano, omushaija oijwire okwikiriza n'Omwoyo Orikwera, na Filipo, na Porokoro, na Nikanoori, na Timoni, na Pamena, na Nikola owa Antiokia, owaahindukiire omu diini y'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:24">Byak 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:3">13:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:23">14:23</ref>. </char></note> Baabeemereza omu maisho g'entumwa; ku baaherize kushaba, baabataho engaro. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ekigambo kya Ruhanga kyayeyongyera kubuga; omubaro gw'abeegi gwakanya munonga omuri Yerusaalemu; kandi abanyamurwa baingi baayorobera okwikiriza.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okukwata Stefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Kandi Stefano, aijwire embabazi n'obushoboorozi, yaakora eby'okutangaaza n'obumanyiso bikuru omu bantu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Kwonka bamwe ab'omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sinagogi n'ekanisa y'ekiyudaaya. </char></note>sinagogi y'Abaliberitiino n'Abanyakureene n'aba Alegizanderia, n'ey'aba Kilikia n'aba Asia, baimuka baahakanisa Stefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kwonka tibaabaasa kusinga obwengye n'Omwoyo ebyabaire nibimugambisa. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Nikwo kuguriirira abantu, abaagizire bati: Tukahurira naagamba ebigambo by'okurogota ahari Musa n'ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Baayosya abantu n'abakuru baabo n'abahandiiki, baamugurukira, baamukwata, baamutwara omu maisho g'eishengyero. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:11">Yer 26:11</ref>. </char></note> Baataho baakareebi ab'ebishuba, abaagizire bati: Omushaija ogu tayosha kugamba kubi aha mwanya ogu ogurikwera n'aha Biragiro; <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />ahakuba tukahurira naagira ati: Yesu ogwo owa Nazareesi aryahwerekyereza omwanya ogu, ahindure emigyenzo ei Musa yaatuhaire. <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Boona abaabaire bashutami omu ishengyero, ku baamutaireho amaisho, baareeba ahamaisho ge nihashusha aha maraika.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetonganira kwa Stefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Omunyamurwa omukuru yaamubuuza ati: Ebyo nikwo biri bityo? <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Kut 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:7">15:7</ref>. </char></note> Stefano yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:2">Beene waitu kandi baataata, muhurire. Ruhanga ow'ekitiinsia akabonekyera tatenkuriitwe Abrahamu, akiri Mesopotamia, atakatwire Harani; <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />yaamuragiira ati: Ruga omu nsi y'owaanyu n'omuri beene waanyu, oze omu nsi ei ndikworeka. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Nawe nikwo kuruga omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya, akatuura Harani. Bwanyima ishe ku yaafiire, Ruhanga yaamwihayo, yaamutaasya omu nsi egi, ei mutwiremu na hati mbwenu. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:15">Kut 13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:4">48:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka taragimuhairemu butaka, nangwa n'obu haakuba ah'okuta ekigyere; kureka akaraganisa kugimuha okuba obutaka bwe n'obw'abaana be bwanyima ye, n'obu araabe yaabaire ataine mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Kut 15:13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kur 12:40</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruhanga yaagira ati: Oruzaaro rwe ruryashuhuukira omu nsi y'abandi; abo baryabagira abahuuku, bamare emyaka magana ana nibabategyeka kubi. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Eihanga eryo eriribahindura abahuuku, nyowe Ruhanga ndyaricwera orubanja; bwanyima y'ebyo baryarugayo, bandamize omu mwanya ogu. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:4">Kut 21:4</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaamuha endagaano y'okusharwa; n'ahabw'ekyo Abrahamu ku yaazaire Isaaka, yaamushara aha kiro kya munaana; na Isaaka yaazaara Yakobo, na Yakobo yaazaara baatatenkuriitwe ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:28">Kut 37:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:21">39:21</ref>. </char></note> Baatatenkuriitwe abo baagirira Yosefu eihari, baamutunda omu nsi ya Misri; kwonka Ruhanga yaaguma nawe, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:38-45">Kut 41:38-45</ref>. </char></note> yaamwiha omu kubonabona kwe kwona, yaamuha okukundwa Faraho omugabe wa Misri n'okuba omunyabwengye omu maisho ge; Faraho ogwo yaamuhindura omutegyeki wa Misri n'ekikaari kye kyona.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:54">Kut 41:54</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima enjara yaataaha omu nsi yoona eya Misri n'eya Kanaani, haabaho obusaasi bwingi; baatatenkuriitwe baabura eby'okurya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:2">Kut 42:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yakobo, ku yaahuriire ngu Misri hariyo engano, yaatumayo baatatenkuriitwe omurundi gw'okubanza. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Aha murundi gwa kabiri Yosefu yaayemanyisa bakuru be; na Faraho yaamanyira aho oruganda rwa Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:3-11">Kut 45:3-11</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu nikwo kutuma ahari Yakobo ishe, akamweta na beene waabo boona, abantu makumi mushanju na bataano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakobo yaashuuma, yaaza Misri; okwo niyo yaagwire, na baatatenkuriitwe; <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:16">Kut 23:16</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 23:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24:32</ref>. </char></note> emitumbi yaabo yaatwarwa Shekemu, yaaziikwa omu kituuro eki Abrahamu yaaguzire n'efeeza ahari batabani ba Hamori owa Shekemu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Kwonka obunaku bw'endagaano ei Ruhanga yaaraganiise Abrahamu ku bwahikire, Abaisraeli baakanya, baaba baingi omuri Misri, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />okuhitsya obu haayemire omugabe ondiijo, owaabaire atarikumanya Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:9">Kur 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 1:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo yaacwa obwengye bw'okuteera aha mutwe eihanga ryaitu, yaagyema baatatenkuriitwe kunaga abaana baabo, ngu batagumaho. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:23">Heb 11:23</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Musa yaazaarwa, kandi akaba ari murungi munonga; yaarererwa omu nju ya ishe okumara ameezi ashatu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:5-15">Kur 2:5-15</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaanagirwe, muhara wa Faraho yaamutwara, yaamworora nk'omwana we. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa yaayegyesibwa obwengye bwona obw'Abanyamisri; yaaba ow'amaani omu bigambo bye n'omu bi yaabaire naakora.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Ku yaahikize emyaka makumi ana, yaizirwa ekitekateeko ky'okutaayaayira beene ishe Abaisraeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ku yaareebire omwe aharibo naaturwa busha, yaamurwanaho, yaamuhoorera, yaita Omunyamisri. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Yaagira ngu beene ishe bakaayetegyereza ku Ruhanga arikwenda kubajunisa omukono gwe; kwonka bo tibaakimanya. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ku bwaseesire, yaashanga babiri nibarwana, yaayenda ngu abaramure abateerane, yaabagira ati: Bashaija 'mwe, ahabw'enki nimukorana kubi, haza muri ab'oruganda rumwe? <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ogwo owaabaire naashaagiza mugyenzi we, yaatsindika Musa naagira ati: N'oha owaakugizire omutegyeki kandi omuramuzi waitu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Nooyenda kuunyita, nk'oku oitsire Omunyamisri nyomwabazyo? <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:15">Kur 2:15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'ekigambo ekyo Musa yaahunga, yaatuura omu nsi ya Midiani nk'omugyenyi, ei yaazaariire abatabani babiri.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:2-8">Kur 3:2-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'emyaka makumi ana, maraika yaamweyorekyera omu rurimi rw'omuriro nigwaka omu rushaka, omu ihamba ry'orushozi Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa ku yaagureebire, yaagutangaarira; ku yairiire haihi kureeba, eiraka rya Mukama ryamugira riti: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />Ndi Ruhanga wa baashwenkuru, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, owa Isaaka, kandi owa Yakobo. Musa yaatetema, yaatiina kugumyayo amaisho. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mukama yaamugira ati: Iha enkaito omu bigyere, ahakuba omwanya ogu oyemereiremu n'ogurikwera. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Buzimazima ndeebire okubonabonesibwa kw'abantu bangye abari omuri Misri, naahurira okutsinda kwabo; mbwenu nshuumire kubajuna. N'ahabw'ekyo ija hati, nkutume Misri.<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kur 2:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa ogwo ou baayangire, nibagira ngu, N'oha owaakugizire omutegyeki kandi omuramuzi, ogwo niwe Ruhanga yaatumire kuba omutegyeki n'omujuni, kubajuna n'omukono gwa maraika owaamubonekyeire aha Rushaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Kur 14:21</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kukora eby'okutangaaza n'obumanyiso omuri Misri, yaabaihayo, yaagumizamu naabikora aha Nyanja erikutukura, n'omu ihamba omu myaka makumi ana. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bir 18:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Musa ogwo niwe yaaraguriire Abaisraeli ati: Ruhanga aryabaimukiza nabi omuri beene waanyu, nk'oku yaanyimukize. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Hoona niwe yaabaire ari ahagati y'omutwe gw'abantu omu ihamba, ari hamwe na maraika owaamugambiriire aha rushozi Sinai, kandi ari hamwe na baatatenkuriitwe; niwe yaahairwe ebigambo by'amagara ngu abituhe. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:3">Kub 14:3</ref>. </char></note> Baatatenkuriitwe baayanga kumworobera, baamutsindika kuriya, kandi omu mitima yaabo baahinduka, baagaruka Misri <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-6">Kur 32:1-6</ref>. </char></note> baagambira Arooni bati: Otukorere baaruhanga, batwebembere; ahakuba Musa ogwo owaatwihire omu nsi ya Misri, titurikumanya oku abaire. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Omu biro ebyo baaheesha ekishushani ky'enyana, baakihongyera ekitambo, baashemerererwa emirimo y'emikono yaabo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5:25-27</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga nikwo kuhinduka, akabareka ngu baramye eihe ry'omu iguru, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya baanabi, ngu: Imwe ab'oruganda rwa Israeli, amatungo n'ebitambo ebi mwatambiire omu ihamba emyaka egyo makumi ana, nimugira ngu niinye mwabitambiire? <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Ngaaha; omu mazima ebi mwabaire nimuheeka n'eihema rya Moloki, n'enyonyoozi ya ruhanga Refani, ebishushani ebi mwayekoreire kuramya. Naanye ndyabatwara, mbarengyeze Babulooni. <verse eid="ACT 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kur 25:40</ref>. </char></note> Baatatenkuriitwe bakaba baine eihema ry'Ebirikuhamya omu ihamba, nk'Owaagambiire Musa oku yaamuragiire kurikora naarishushanisa n'ekishushani eki yaareebire. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Eihema eryo niryo baatatenkuriitwe baahairwe baishebo, bakaritaasya omu nsi egi, obu baija na Yoshua, bakakubuura ensi y'Abanyamahanga abu Ruhanga yaabingire omu maisho gaabo okuhitsya aha busingye bwa Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2">2 Sam 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ogwo, ku yaatungire obuganzi omu maisho ga Ruhanga, yaashaba kwikirizibwa kusherurira Ruhanga wa Yakobo ah'okutuura. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1">1 Bag 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Sulemaani niwe yaamwombekyeire enju. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Haza Rukira-boona atatuura mu maju agombekirwe emikono, nk'oku nabi yaagizire ati:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Eiguru nikyo kitebe kyangye ky'obukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">N'ensi n'akatebe k'ebigyere byangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ni nju ki ei muriinyombekyera? Nikwo Mukama arikubuuza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nari shi ni mwanya ki ogu ndihuumuriramu?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Omukono gwangye tigwo gwahangire ebyo byona?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:9">Kur 32:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe ab'ebitsya bigangaire, abatashazirwe mu mitima n'omu matu, murwanisa obutoosha Omwoyo Orikwera! Nk'oku baashwenkuriimwe baakozire, naimwe nikwo mukora. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Bus 36:16</ref>. </char></note> Ni nabi ki ou baashwenkuriimwe batarahiigire? Bakaita abo abaarangire okwija kw'Ogwo ohikiriire; mbwenu naimwe mukamureebya, mwamwita, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:2">Heb 2:2</ref>. </char></note> imwe abaahairwe Ebiragiro nk'oku byaragiirwe baamaraika, haza mutabyorobere.<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okwitsa Stefano amabaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ku baahuriire ebyo, baagira ekiniga kingi, baamunenera amaino. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:69">Luk 22:69</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka we, aijwire Omwoyo Orikwera, yaagumya amaisho ge ahaiguru, yaareeba ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga, na Yesu ayemereire aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga; <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />yaagira ati: Reeba, nindeeba eiguru rikinguukire, n'Omwana w'omuntu ayemereire aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Baayomba munonga, baayekwata aha matu, baamweshukaho; <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:20">Byak 22:20</ref>. </char></note> baamutsindika aheeru y'orurembo, baamuteera amabaare; kandi baamushinja baatambika ebijwaro byabo aha bigyere by'omutsigazi orikwetwa Saulo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:59: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:46">Luk 23:46</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo baateire Stefano amabaare, naashaba naagira ati: Mukama wangye Yesu, yakiira omwoyo gwangye. <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:34">Luk 23:34</ref>. </char></note> Yaatsimba amaju, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Mukama wangye, otabatura ekibi eki. Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaagwejegyera.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Okutaataana kw'Abakristaayo ahabw'okuhiigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Kandi Saulo akasiima okwitwa kwe. Aha izooba eryo baatandika kuhiiga munonga ekanisa y'omuri Yerusaalemu; boona baataataanira omu byanga bya Buyudaaya na Samaria, okwihaho entumwa zonka. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Abashaija abarikutiina Ruhanga baaziika Stefano, baamucurira munonga. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4">Byak 22:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Saulo we yaaguma naashiisha ekanisa, naataaha omuri buri nju, naakwata abashaija n'abakazi, naabata omu kihome.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo okuza Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />N'ahabw'ekyo abaataataine baagyenda hoona nibabuurira ekigambo. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Byak 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Filipo yaashuuma, yaaza omu rurembo rwa Samaria, yaababuurira Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Emitwe mingi y'abantu, ku baabaire bahurira ebi Filipo arikugamba, baareeba obumanyiso obu arikukora, baabiikiriza n'omutima gumwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ahabw'okuba baingi aharibo abaabaire bariho baadaimoni, baadaimoni bakaba babarugaho nibaamuza munonga; kandi baingi abaabaire bazingazingirwe, n'abaremaire, bakizibwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Haabaho okushemererwa kwingi omu rurembo orwo.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Simooni omufumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Kandi hakaba hariho omushaija orikwetwa Simooni, owaabaire akora eby'obufumu omu rurembo orwo, naatangaaza eihanga ry'Abasamaria, naayeyeta omuntu mukuru. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Abantu boona, okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru, bakaba bamutiina, nibagira bati: Omushaija ogu niwe maani ga Ruhanga ageetwa Rugambwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bakaba bamutiina, ahabw'okuba akaba amazire omwanya muhango naabatangaaza n'obufumu bwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kwonka ku baikiriize Filipo owaababuuriire ebigambo birungi eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga n'eiziina rya Yesu Kristo, baabatizibwa, abashaija n'abakazi. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Kandi Simooni nawe yaikiriza; ku yaaherize kubatizibwa, yaaguma na Filipo; ku yaareebire naakora obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza bikuru, yaatangaara munonga.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Kandi entumwa ezaabaire ziri Yerusaalemu, ku zaahuriire ngu aba Samaria baikiriize ekigambo kya Ruhanga, zaabatumaho Petero na Yohaana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nabo, ku baahikireyo, baabashabira ngu baheebwe Omwoyo Orikwera; <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />ahakuba Omwoyo akaba atakaizire aha muntu weena omuribo, kureka bakaba babatiziibwe omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:14">1 Tim 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Petero na Yohaana baabataho engaro, baaheebwa Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simooni, ku yaareebire baaheebwa Omwoyo Orikwera ahabw'okuteebwaho engaro z'entumwa, yaazireetera empiiha, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />naagira ati: Naanye mumpe amaani aga, weena ou ndaateho engaro aheebwe Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Kwonka Petero yaamugarukamu ati: Efeeza yaawe ebure naiwe, ahabw'okuba waateekateeka kugura ekiconco kya Ruhanga n'empiiha. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Toine mugabo n'obu kwakuba okukwatanisa naitwe omu kigambo eki; ahabw'okuba omutima gwawe tiguri gye mu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo oyeteise obubi bwawe obu, oshabe Mukama, shana akaakusaasira ekiteekateeko ky'omu mutima gwawe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nindeeba ku ori omu ndurwe erikushaarira n'omu nkomo z'obubi. <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simooni yaagarukamu naagira ati: Munshabire ahari Mukama, byona ebi mwagamba bitampikaho. <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Bwanyima entumwa, ku zaaherize kuhamya ekigambo kya Mukama n'okukigamba, zaagaruka Yerusaalemu, nizibuurira engiri omu birorero bingi eby'Abasamaria.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhinduka kw'Omunyesiopia omukonwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Maraika wa Mukama yaagambira Filipo ati: Imuka ogyende, otoore omuhanda gw'eihamba ogw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo ogurikushuuma, okuruga Yerusaalemu okuhika Gaaza. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Yaimuka, yaagyenda. Kandi hakaba hariho omushaija omukonwa owa Esiopia, ow'obushoboorozi bwingi, obu yaahairwe Kandake, omugabekazi wa Esiopia, owaabaire ari omubiiki w'ebintu bye byona; ogwo akaba agiire Yerusaalemu kuramya. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Ku yaabaire naagaruka owaabo, ashutami omu kigaari kye, naashoma ekitabo kya nabi Isaaya, <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Omwoyo yaagambira Filipo, ati: Hika ekigaari kiriya, ogyende nakyo. <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo yairuka, yaamuhika, yaahurira naashoma omu kitabo kya nabi Isaaya, yaamubuuza ati: Nooshoborokyerwa ebi orikushoma? <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Nimbaasa nta, ntaine w'okunshobororera? Yaashaba Filipo ngu atembe omu kigaari, ashutame nawe. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekicweka eky'omu Byahandiikirwe eki yaabaire naashoma, kikaba kiri eki ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Akatwarwa kwitwa nk'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Kandi nk'omwana gw'entaama oku gucureera omu maisho g'omukyemuzi waagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Nikwo ataraashamize kanwa ke.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Omu kugarurwa ahansi kwe bakamwitira orubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Oruganda rwe n'oha orirushoboorora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Ahakuba amagara ge gakaihwa omu nsi.<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Omukonwa yaabuuza Filipo naagira ati: Ninkushaba onshobororere, nabi ogwo akagamba ahari oha? Akeegambaho, nari akagamba aha muntu ondiijo? <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipo yaatandika kugamba naihirira aha Byahandiikirwe ebyo, yaamugambira ebya Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:47">Byak 10:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibakigyenda, baahika aha maizi; omukonwa yaagira ati: Reeba, amaizi ngaga! Ekirikunzibira kubatizibwa niki? <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo yaamugira ati: Ku oraabe waikiriza n'omutima gwawe gwona, nikibaasika. Yaagarukamu ati: Niinyikiriza ku Yesu Kristo ari Omwana wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Atyo yaaragiira ku beemereza ekigaari; bombi Filipo n'omukonwa baashuuma omu maizi; yaamubatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:12">1 Bag 18:12</ref>. </char></note> Ku baarugire omu maizi, Omwoyo wa Mukama yaatwara Filipo, omukonwa tiyaagaruka kumureeba; kureka yaagumizamu, yaagyenda ashemereirwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:8">Byak 21:8</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 21:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Filipo we yaashangwa Azooto; bwanyima yaagyenda naabuurira engiri omuri tauni zoona okuhitsya obu yaahikire Kaisarea.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhinduka kwa Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1-29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:3-21">Byak 22:3-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-20">26:9-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Saulo, ku yaabaire naakigamba eby'okukangisa n'eby'okwita abeegi ba Mukama, yaaza aha munyamurwa omukuru, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />yaamushaba kuhandiikira sinagogi za Damasiko ebaruha ngu, ku araashangyeyo abarikwikiriza eby'Omuhanda ogwo, yaaba abashaija nari abakazi, abatware Yerusaalemu babohirwe. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:8">1 Kor 15:8</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naakigyenda, yaahika haihi na Damasiko, omushana ogurikuruga omu iguru gwamujwera gumwehinguririize, <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />yaagwa ahansi, yaahurira eiraka nirimugira riti: Saulo, Saulo, nompiigira ki? <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Yaagarukamu ati: Ori oha, Mukama wangye? We ati: Niinye Yesu ou orikuhiiga. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Yaatetema ashobeirwe, yaabuuza ati: Mukama wangye, nooyenda ngu ngire nta? Mukama yaamugarukamu ati: Imuka, otaahe omu rurembo, noija kugambirwa ebi oshemereire kukora. <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Abashaija abaabire nibagyenda nawe baayemerera bahunami, nibahurira eiraka, kwonka batarikureeba muntu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saulo yaimuka ahansi; ku yaabuurwire amaisho, tiyaahweza kintu; baamukwata omukono, baamutwara Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Yaamarayo ebiro bishatu atarikuhweza, kandi atarikurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anania okubatiza Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Kandi Damasiko hakaba hariyo omwegi orikwetwa Anania. Mukama waitu yaamugambira omu kworekwa ati: Anania! Yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi aha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mukama waitu yaamugira ati: Imuka oze omu muhanda ogurikwetwa Ogugororokire, obuuze omu nju ya Yuda omuntu orikwetwa Saulo owa Taruso; ahakuba hati naashaba. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Kandi areebire omu kworekwa omushaija orikwetwa Anania naija kumutaho engaro ngu ahumuukye. <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Kwonka Anania yaagarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, nkahurira baingi nibagamba aha mushaija ogwo, ku yaakozire kubi munonga abarikwera baawe omuri Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:16">Byak 22:16</ref>. </char></note> na mbwenu aha aine obushoboorozi, obu aihire aha banyamurwa abakuru, kuboha boona abarikwikiriza eiziina ryawe. <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kwonka Mukama yaamugira ati: Irooko ogyende; ahakuba omushaija ogwo n'ekintu kyangye eki ntooraine okutwara eiziina ryangye omu maisho g'Abanyamahanga n'abagabe n'Abaisraeli; <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:23-28">2 Kor 11:23-28</ref>. </char></note> naanye ndyamworeka obusaasi bwingi obu ashemereire kwemera ahabw'eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Anania nikwo kugyenda, akataaha omu nju egyo; akamutaho engaro, akamugira ati: Ow'eishe-emwe Saulo, Mukama waitu Yesu, okweyorekyeire omu muhanda ogu oreetsirwemu, yantuma ngu ohumuukye, oijure Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ahonaaho ebintu ebiri nk'ebikoko byamuruga aha maisho, yaahumuuka; yaayemerera, yaabatizibwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Ku yaaherize kurya eby'okurya, yaagarukwamu amaani. Bwanyima yaamara ebiro bikye n'abeegi Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ahonaaho yaatandika kugamba Yesu omuri sinagogi, ku ari Omwana wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Boona abaamuhuriire baatangaara nibagira bati: ogu t'omushaija owaabaire anyangaraza aba Yerusaalemu abaabaire batakira eiziina eryo? Kandi ekyo nikyo kibaire kimureetsire n'aha, ngu abatware babohirwe omu maisho g'abanyamurwa abakuru. <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Kwonka Saulo yaayeyongyera kutunga amaani, yaakwatsa enshoni Abayudaaya abaabaire batwire Damasiko, naahamiza kimwe ku Yesu ari Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okuhungira Yerusaalemu, n'okureeba entumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:12-29">Byak 23:12-29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro bingi ku byahingwireho, Abayudaaya baacuma enaama y'okumwita; <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />kwonka enaama yaabo Saulo yaagimanya. Baamugwera aha marembo nyomushana na nyekiro, ngu bamwite; <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:32">2 Kor 11:32</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref>. </char></note> kwonka abeegi be baamucwisa nyekiro, baamurengyeza aha rugo rw'amabaare, baamushuumiza omu kitukuru. <verse eid="ACT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:17-19">Gal 1:17-19</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikire Yerusaalemu, yaateeraho kwehitsya abeegi; kwonka boona baamutiina, tibaikiriza ku ari omwegi. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Kwonka Barunaba yaamutwara, yaamuhitsya entumwa, yaabashobororera oku yaareebire Mukama akiri omu muhanda, Mukama akagamba nawe, kandi n'oku yaabuuriire n'obumanzi omu iziina rya Yesu omuri Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Yaaguma naataayaayira ab'omuri Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />naabuurira n'obumanzi omu iziina rya Mukama. Kandi yaahakanisa Abahelenesti; nabo baasherura oku baraamwite. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:25">Byak 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:21">Gal 1:21</ref>. </char></note> Ab'eishe-emwe ku baakimanyire, baamutwara Kaisarea, baamwohereza Taruso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okukiza Ainea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />N'ahabw'ekyo ekanisa y'omuri Buyudaaya yoona na Galilaaya na Samaria yaagira obusingye yahamibwa; abantu baayeyongyera kukanya nibagyendera omu kutiina Mukama, bahangainwe Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Omu biro ebyo Petero, ku yaabaire naataayaayira hoona, yaashuuma, yaataayaayira n'abarikwera abaabaire batwire Luuda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Yaashangayo omushaija orikwetwa Ainea, owaabaire amazire emyaka munaana abyami aha kitanda ahabw'okuzingazingwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petero yaamugira ati: Ainea, Yesu Kristo yaakutambira; imuka, oyeyarire. Ahonaaho yaimuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Abaabaire batwire Luuda na Sharooni boona ku baamureebire, baahindukira Mukama.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okuzoora Tabisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Omuri Yoopa hakaba harimu omwegi orikwetwa Tabisa, amakuru gaaryo ni Doruka, nari Esirabo; omukazi ogwo akaba akora emirimo mingi mirungi n'eby'embabazi eby'okuhwera abooro. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Omu biro ebyo akarwara, yaafa. Ku baaherize kwozya omutumbi gwe, baagubyamya omuri kanyinaibiri. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Kandi ahabwa Luuda kuba haihi na Yoopa, abeegi ku baahuriire ngu Petero niyo ari, baamutumaho abashaija babiri, baamweshengyereza nibagira bati: Orahukye, oije otureebe. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petero yaimuka, yaagyenda nabo. Ku yaahikireyo, baamutembya omuri kanyinaibiri; n'abafaakazi boona baija, baamwemerera haihi nibarira, nibooreka amakanzu n'ebijwaro ebi Doruka yaakozire akiriho. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petero yaabashohoza, yaatsimba amaju, yaashaba; yaahindukira omutumbi, yaagira ati: Tabisa, imuka. Yaabuuruura amaisho; ku yaareebire Petero yaashutama. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petero yaamuha omukono, yaamwimutsya, yaayeta abarikwera n'abafaakazi, yaamubooreka ahuriire. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Ekyo kyamanywa omuri Yoopa yoona; baingi baikiriza Mukama. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Bwanyima yaamara ebiro bingi omuri Yoopa omu nju ya Simooni omuhazi w'empu.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Maraika okubonekyera Koruneelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:5">Mat 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:1">Byak 27:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri Kaisarea hakaba harimu omushaija orikwetwa Koruneelio, omukuru w'abaserukare b'omu mutwe ogurikwetwa Italiano; <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />akaba ari omunyadiini, orikutiina Ruhanga hamwe n'ab'omu ka ye boona, owaabaire ahwera abooro n'ebintu bye bingi, kandi naashaba Ruhanga obutoosha. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Eizooba rimwe aha shaaha nk'eya mwenda akareeba maraika wa Ruhanga omu kworekwa naija ah'ari, yaamugira ati: Koruneelio. <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />We yaamuhanga amaisho aine obwoba, yaamubuuza ati: N'enki, Mukama wangye? Yaamugarukamu ati: Okushaba kwawe n'obuhwezi bwawe bitembire okuba ekiijutsyo ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Mbwenu tuma abashaija Yoopa, beeteyo omuntu Simooni orikwetwa Petero, <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />orikuraara owa Simooni omuhazi w'empu, enju ye eri aha rubaju rw'enyanja. <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Maraika owaabarize nawe ku yaagyenzire, Koruneelio yaatuma abambari be babiri, n'omuserukare omunyadiini w'omuri abo abaabaire bamuheereza obutoosha; <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />ku yaaherize kubateekyerereza byona, yaabatuma Yoopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okworekwa kwa Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Omu kasheeshe, abo abaatumirwe ku baabaire bahika haihi na tauni egyo, bakiri omu rugyendo rwabo, Petero yaatemba aha mutwe gw'enju kushaba aha shaaha nk'eya mukaaga; <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />yaagira enjara, yaayenda kurya; ku baabaire nibaihura, yaaba nk'orikuroota; <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />yaareeba eiguru rikinguukire, n'ekintu ekirikushusha nk'omwenda muhango munonga, ogukwatsirwe aha nshonda ina, nikishuuma ahansi, <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />kirimu enganda zoona z'enyamaishwa n'ebirikugyendesa enda n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Yaahurira eiraka nirimugira riti: Petero, imuka, oite orye. <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:14">Ezk 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Lev 11:1-47</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Petero yaagira ati: Ngaaha, Mukama wangye; ahabw'okuba tinkaryaga kintu kyona ekirikuzira nari ekitashemeire. <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:11">Mat 15:11</ref>. </char></note> Eiraka ryagaruka ryamugambira obwa kabiri riti: Eki Ruhanga yashemeize, otarikihindura ekirikuzira. <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ebyo byabaho bityo kashatu; ahonaaho ekintu ekyo kyagarurwa omu iguru.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petero ku yaabaire arimbagiriirwe, akishobeirwe amakuru g'okworekwa okwo oku yaareeba, abashaija abo, abatumirwe Koruneelio, ku baaherize kuhabuza enju ya Simooni, baija, baayemerera aha irembo, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />baayeta nibabuuza bati: Simooni orikwetwa Petero naaraara aha? <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petero ku yaabaire naakiteekateeka aha kworekwa, Omwoyo yaamugira ati: Reeba, abashaija bashatu nibakusherura; <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />imuka oshuume, ogyende nabo otarikubanganisa; ahakuba niinye naabatuma. <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petero nikwo kushuuma, akabahika, akabagira ati: Niinye ou murikusherura. Muhuutsirwe ki? <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Baamugira bati: Koruneelio, omukuru w'abaserukare, omushaija ohikiriire, orikutiina Ruhanga, kandi orikusiimwa eihanga ry'Abayudaaya ryona, aragiirwe maraika orikwera kukweta kwija omu ka ye, ngu ahurire ebi oraamugambire. <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:12">Byak 11:12</ref>. </char></note> Yaabataasya omu nju, yaabaraaza. Ku bwaseesire, Petero yaimuka, yaagyenda nabo hamwe n'ab'eishe-emwe bamwe aba Yoopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero na Koruneelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Aha kiro ekindi baataaha Kaisarea. Baashanga Koruneelio abategyereize n'abanywani be buzima. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petero ku yaabaire naakitaaha, Koruneelio yaamubugana, yaamugwa aha bigyere, yaamuramya. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15">Byak 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:10">Kush 19:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Petero yaamwimutsya, naagira ati: Imuka; naanye ndi omuntu nkaiwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Ku yaabaire naakigamba nawe, yaataahamu, yaashanga baingi bateeraine; <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />yaabagira ati: Imwe nimumanya ku kizira Omuyudaaya okukwatanisa n'omuntu w'eihanga erindi, n'obu kwakuba kumutaayaayira; kwonka nyowe Ruhanga akaanyoreka ku ntashemereire kunuga muntu weena nari shi okumweta otashemeire. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />N'ahabw'ekyo, ku nyetsirwe, tinaayanga kwija. Nikyo ndikubuuriza eki muunyeteire. <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koruneelio yaagira ati: Ebiro bina ebihingwire mbaire ninshabira omu nju yangye aha shaaha y'okushaba eya mwenda; ku mbaire ninshaba, naareeba omushaija anyemereire omu maisho, ajwaire ebijwaro ebirikwengyengyeta, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />yaagira ati: Koruneelio, okushaba kwawe kuhuriirwe, n'obuhwezi bwawe bwijukirwe ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />N'ahabw'ekyo tuma Yoopa, oyeteyo Simooni orikwetwa Petero; hati naaraara omu nju ya Simooni omuhazi w'empu aha rubaju rw'enyanja. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ahonaaho naakutumaho; kandi naiwe waakora gye kwija. Mbwenu hati turi aha twena omu maisho ga Ruhanga okuhurira byona ebi oragiirwe Mukama.<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okubuurira engiri owa Koruneelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:7">1 Sam 16:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Petero yaatandika kugamba, naagira ati: Buzimazima naayetegyereza ku Ruhanga atashoroora mu bantu; <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:31">Yoh 9:31</ref>. </char></note> kureka omu mahanga goona orikumutiina, akakora eby'okuhikiirira, ogwo niwe arikusiimwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:15">Nah 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Ekigambo ky'engiri y'obusingye obu tuhairwe ahabwa Yesu Kristo, (niwe Mukama wa boona,) Ruhanga akakyoherereza Abaisraeli. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Ekigambo ekyo naimwe nimukimanya, nikyo kyagambirwe omuri Buyudaaya yoona, okutandikira Galilaaya, bwanyima y'okubuurira kwa Yohaana okw'okubatiza; <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>. </char></note> nikigamba ebya Yesu owa Nazareesi, oku Ruhanga yaamushukireho Omwoyo Orikwera n'amaani, akagyendagyenda naakora ebirungi, naakiza boona abaabaire nibaitwa kubi Sitaane; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akaba ari hamwe nawe. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Naitwe turi baakareebi b'ebyo byona ebi yaakozire omu nsi y'Abayudaaya n'omuri Yerusaalemu. Yesu ogwo bakamwita, bamuhanikire aha muti; <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />kwonka Ruhanga yaamuzoora aha kiro kya kashatu yaamworeka butunu, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />ti mu bantu boona, kureka ahari baakareebi, abaatoorainwe Ruhanga ira, nibo itwe abaariire kandi abaanyweire nawe aherize kuzooka omu bafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:9">Rom 14:9</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 14:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:5">1 Pet 4:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaaturagiira kubuurira abantu, n'okuhamya ngu niwe ogwo ou Ruhanga yaataireho kuba Omucwi w'emanja z'abahuriire n'abafiire. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 53:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo niwe baanabi boona baahamize, ngu ahabw'eiziina rye omuntu weena orikumwikiriza naihwaho ebibi.<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamahanga okuheebwa Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petero ku yaabaire naakigamba ebigambo ebyo, Omwoyo Orikwera yaashuuma ahari boona abaabaire nibahurira ekigambo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Abaikiriize ab'omu bashazirwe, abaizire na Petero boona, baatangaara ahabw'Abanyamahanga nabo kushukwaho ekiconco ky'Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:6">Byak 19:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba bakabahurira nibagamba “omu ndimi”, nibahimbisa Ruhanga. Petero nikwo kubuuza ati: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />Abantu aba abaaheebwa Omwoyo Orikwera nkaitwe, hariho orikubaasa kubaima amaizi ngu batabatizibwa? <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Yaaragiira ngu babatizibwe omu iziina rya Yesu Kristo. Bwanyima baamweshengyereza kumarayo ebiro bikye.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Petero okwetonganira aha Bakristaayo b'Abayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Entumwa n'ab'eishe-emwe abaabaire bari Buyudaaya bakahurira ngu Abanyamahanga nabo baikiriize ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Petero ku yaagarukire Yerusaalemu, ab'omu kigombe ky'abashazirwe baahakana nawe, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:12">Gal 2:12</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Okataaha omu bantu abatashazirwe, kandi waarya nabo. <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Petero yaatandika kubashobororera byona oku byakurataine, naagira ati: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Nyowe nkaba ndi omuri tauni Yoopa, ninshaba; naashusha nk'orikuroota, naayorekwa ekintu, ekirikushusha nk'omwenda muhango munonga ogukwatsirwe aha nshonda ina, nikishuuma okuruga omu iguru; kyampikaho. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ku naakigumizeho amaisho, naayetegyereza, naareeba enyamaishwa z'omu nsi z'amaguru ana, n'endi z'abantu, n'ebirikugyendesa enda, n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kandi naahurira n'eiraka eririkungambira riti: Petero, imuka oite orye. <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Kwonka nyowe naagira nti: Ngaaha, Mukama wangye! Ahabw'okuba ekintu ekirikuzira nari ekitashemeire tikikahikaga mu kanwa kangye. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Kwonka eiraka ryangarukamu obwa kabiri, niriruga omu iguru riti: Eki Ruhanga yashemeize, otarikihindura ekirikuzira. <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ekyo kyabaho kashatu; bwanyima byona byagarurwa omu iguru.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Omu shaaha egyo abashaija bashatu baayemerera omu maisho g'enju, ei twabaire turimu, batumirwe ahariinye nibaruga Kaisarea. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Omwoyo yandagiira kugyenda nabo ntarikubanganisa. Nikwo kugyenda n'ab'eishe-emwe mukaaga, tukataaha omu nju y'omushaija ogwo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Nawe akatuteekyerereza oku yaareebire maraika ayemereire omu nju ye, naagira ati: Tuma Yoopa, oyeteyo Simooni orikwetwa Petero; <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />ogwo aryakugambira ebigambo ebirikujunisa n'ab'omu ka yaawe boona. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ku naatandikire kugamba, Omwoyo Orikwera yaabashuumaho, nk'oku yaizire ahariitwe bwa mbere. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ahonaaho naijuka ekigambo kya Mukama, eki yaagambire ati: Buzimazima Yohaana akabatiza n'amaizi; kwonka imwe muryabatizibwa n'Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Mbwenu, Ruhanga ku araabe yaabahaire ekiconco nk'eki yaatuhaire obu twaikiriza Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, nyowe nkaba ndi oha okurwanisa Ruhanga? <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">Byak 14:27</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahuriire ebyo, baacureera, baahimbisa Ruhanga nibagira bati: Mbwenu Ruhanga ahaire n'Abanyamahanga okweteisa ngu baheebwe amagara agatahwaho.<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Engiri okuhika Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Byak 8:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abaataataanisiibwe okuhiigwa okwabaireho ahabw'ebya Stefano, baagyenda baahika Foiniike na Kupuro n'omuri Antiokia, bataine u barikugambira ekigambo kureka Abayudaaya bonka. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Kwonka hakaba hariho bamwe aharibo, abashaija ba Kupuro na Kureene; abo ku baahikire Antiokia, baagambira n'Abagriika, nibababuurira ebya Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Omukono gwa Mukama gukaba guri aharibo, omutwe mwingi gw'abantu abaikiriize baahindukira Mukama. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Enkuru zaabyo zaahurirwa ekanisa ey'omuri Yerusaalemu, baatuma Barunaba Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ku yaahikireyo, yaareeba embabazi za Ruhanga, yaashemererwa; yaabeehanangiriza boona kuguma ahari Mukama n'omutima oguhamire. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barunaba ogwo akaba ari omushaija murungi, oijwire Omwoyo Orikwera n'okwikiriza; kandi abantu baingi baija, baayehongyera Mukama. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Bwanyima yaarugayo, yaaza Taruso kusherura Saulo; <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:28">Byak 26:28</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:16">1 Pet 4:16</ref>. </char></note> ku yaamureebire, yaamureeta Antiokia. Okuruga aho baamarayo omwaka gwona, nibakwatanisa n'ekanisa yaayo, nibeegyesa abantu baingi. Kandi Antiokia okwo abeegi niyo batandikiire kwetwa Abakristaayo.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Omu biro ebyo baanabi aba Yerusaalemu baija Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Byak 21:10</ref>. </char></note> Omwe aharibo orikwetwa Agabo yaayemerera, yaaragurira omu Mwoyo ku haribaho enjara nyingi munonga omu nsi yoona; niyo njara eyaabaireho omu biro bya Kulaudio. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:10">Gal 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Abeegi baayo baamariirira, buri muntu nk'oku yaabaasize, kwohereza eby'okuhwera ab'eishe-emwe abaabaire batwire Buyudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:25">Byak 12:25</ref>. </char></note> Baakora batyo, baabyoherereza abakuru, byatwarwa Barunaba na Saulo.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Petero okwihwa omu kihome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:3">Byak 4:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo omugabe Heroode akakwata bamwe aha b'omu kanisa okubakora kubi. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Yakobo mukuru wa Yohaana yaamwitsa rurara. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ku yaareebire Abayudaaya baakisiima, yaagaruka yaakwata na Petero. (Ebiro ebyo bikaba biri eby'Emigaati Etatumbisiibwe.) <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ku yaaherize kumukwata, yaamuta omu kihome, yaamutaho abaserukare ikumi na mukaaga kumurinda bana-bana, amaririire kumureeta omu maisho g'abantu bwanyima y'Okuhingurwaho. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:16">Yak 5:16</ref>. </char></note> Petero nikwo yaarinzirwe atyo omu kihome. Kwonka ekanisa yaayezirika kumushabira ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Heroode ku yaabaire naayenda kumubareetera omu kasheeshe, ekiro ekyo Petero akaba agwejegyeire ari ahagati y'abaserukare babiri, n'abarinzi bari aha rwigi barinzire ekihome. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:19">Byak 5:19</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa Mukama yaamwemerera aha rubaju, omushana gwajwa omu kishengye; yaateerateera Petero omu mbaju, yaamusisiimura, yaagira ati: Rahuka kwimuka. Enjegyere zaamuruga aha mikono. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Maraika yaamugira ati: Yezirikye, ojware enkaito zaawe. Yaakora atyo. Kandi ati: Jwara omunagiro gwawe, onkurate. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Yaashohora, yaamukuratira; kwonka tiyaamanya ekyakorwa maraika yaaba kiri eky'amazima, kureka yaateekateeka ngu n'okworekwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ku baahingwire aha barinzi b'okubanza n'aba kabiri, baahika aha rwigi rw'ekyoma, orurikuza omu irembo. Orwigi orwo rwabaigukira rwonka; baashohora, baahingura omu muhanda gumwe; ahonaaho maraika yaamutsigaho. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Petero ku yaagarukirwe omutima omunda, yaagira ati: Mbwenu naamanyira kimwe ku Mukama yaatuma maraika we kunjuna omu mikono ya Heroode, n'okunkiza omuri byona ebi Abayudaaya baabaire baineho amatsiko.<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:37">Byak 15:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabyetegyereize, yaaza owa Mariamu nyina wa Yohaana orikwetwa Mako; okwo niyo baabaire bateeraniire baingi nibashaba. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Ku yaakongootsire aha rwigi rw'eirembo, omwishiki orikwetwa Rooda yaija kwetaba. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ku yaamanyire eiraka rya petero, okushemererwa kwamuzibira kwiguraho orwigi, yaagaruka omu nju nairuka, yaabagira ati: Petero ayemereire aha irembo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:37">Luk 24:37</ref>. </char></note> Baamugira bati: Ogwire eiraro. Omwishiki yaahamiza kimwe ku nikwo kiri. Baagira bati: Ni maraika we. <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Kwonka Petero yaagumizamu naakongoota; ku baigwireho, baamureeba, baatangaara munonga. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Yaabacureeza n'omukono, yaabateekyerereza oku Mukama yaamwiha omu kihome. Kandi yaagira ati: Mubigambire Yakobo n'ab'eishe-emwe. Atyo yaarugayo, yaaza ahandi. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ku bwaseesire, haabaho okujagarara kwingi omu baserukare ahabw'okushoberwa oku Petero abaire. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Heroode ku yaatumire kumweta, yaashanga abuzire, yaabuuza munonga abarinzi; atyo yaaragiira ku babaita. Bwanyima yaaruga Buyudaaya, yaaza Kaisarea, yaagumayo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Heroode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Heroode akaba agwereirwe kubi munonga aba Tuuro na Sidoni. Nabo baija ah'ari n'omutima gumwe; ku baaherize kunywana na Bulasto omukuru w'abambari b'omugabe, baashaba obusingye, ahakuba ensi yaabo ekaba neeshaka omu nsi y'omugabe. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Aha kiro eki yaataireho, Heroode yaajwara ebijwaro by'obugabe, yaashutama aha kitebe kye, yaabagambira ebigambo bye. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ezk 28:2</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: Eiraka eri n'erya ruhanga, ti ry'omuntu. <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:20">Dan 5:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho maraika wa Mukama yaamuteera, ahakuba tarahaire Ruhanga kitiinisa; yaariibwa enyogori, yaafa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:11">Isa 55:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ekigambo kya Ruhanga kyayeyongyera, kandi kyakanya. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:37">Byak 15:37</ref>. </char></note> Barunaba na Saulo, ku baaherize omurimo gwabo gw'okuheereza, baaruga Yerusaalemu, baagarukayo, nibatwara Yohaana orikwetwa Mako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Orugyendo rwa Paulo orw'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Omu kanisa eyaabaire eri Antiokia hakaba harimu baanabi n'abeegyesa, Barunaba na Simeoni orikwetwa Niga na Lukio owa Kureene na Manaeni owaarezirwe hamwe n'Oweishaza Heroode, na Saulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ku baabaire nibaheereza Mukama nibeesiibyakwo, Omwoyo Orikwera yaagira ati: Muntooranire Barunaba na Saulo, bakore omurimo ogu mbeeteire. <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:23">Byak 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:14">1 Tim 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:22">5:22</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kwesiibyakwo n'okushaba, baabataho engaro, baaboohereza.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Eluma omurogi owa Kupuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ku baatumirwe Omwoyo Orikwera, baashuuma Selukia; okwo baaragarirayo omu meeri, baayambuka Kupuro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ku baabaire bari Salami, baabuurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga omuri sinagogi z'Abayudaaya; kandi bakaba baine Yohaana nk'omuhereza waabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ku baaherize kuraba omuri ekyo kirwa kyona, baahika Paafo; okwo baashangayo omushaija omurogi, nabi w'ebishuba, Omuyudaaya, orikwetwa Bayesu; <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />kandi akaba atwire n'Oweishaza Omutegyeki, orikwetwa Serugiro Paulo, omushaija w'omunyabwengye. Ogwo yaayeta Barunaba na Saulo, naayenda kuhurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kwonka Eluma omurogi (ahakuba nigo makuru g'eiziina rye) yaabahakanisa, ngu abone kuhabisa Oweishaza ataikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Kwonka Saulo, niwe Paulo, aijwire Omwoyo Orikwera, yaamutaho amaisho, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />naagira ati: Iwe oijwire obugobya bwona n'obubi bwona, iwe mwana wa Sitaane 'we, omuzigu w'okuhikiirira kwona, torireka kukiikamya emihanda ya Mukama egororokire? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Mbwenu hati omukono gwa Mukama nigukuhana, noija kuhuma, noomara omwanya otarikureeba mushana. Ahonaaho oruho n'omwirima byamushweka; yaabandagira, naasherura ow'okumwebembera amukwaitse omukono. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Okuruga aho oweishaza, ku yaareebire ebyakorwa, yaikiriza, ahabw'okuba akatangaarira okwegyesa kwa Mukama.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebyabaire Antiokia ey'omuri Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Bwanyima Paulo n'abagyenzi be baaruga Paafo omu meeri, baayambuka, baahika Peruga ey'omuri Pamfulia. Yohaana yaabatsigayo, yaagaruka Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />kwonka bo ku baahingwire nibaruga Peruga, baahika Antiokia ey'omuri Pisidia. Baataaha omuri sinagogi aha izooba rya Sabato, baashutama. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:21">Byak 15:21</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'okushoma Ebiragiro n'ebya Baanabi, abakuru ba sinagogi baabeeta, baabagira bati: B'eishe-emwe, ku muraabe mwine ekigambo ky'okugumya abantu, mukigambe. <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paulo nikwo kwimuka, akaimutsya omukono, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">Imwe bashaija ba Israeli 'mwe, naimwe abarikutiina Ruhanga, muhurire. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Ruhanga ow'eihanga eri ry'Israeli akatoorana baatatenkuriitwe, yaakuza abantu abo obu baabaire batwire omu nsi ya Misri; bwanyima yaabaihisayo omukono gw'amaani. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Kub 14:34</ref>. </char></note> Yaamara emyaka nka makumi ana abagumisiririize omu ihamba. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:2">Yos 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kuhwerekyereza amahanga mushanju omu nsi ya Kanaani, yaabaha ensi yaabo kuba obuhunguzi, <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Bar 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam 3:20</ref>. </char></note> baamarayo emyaka nka magana ana na makumi ataano; bwanyima y'ebyo yaabaha abaramuzi okuhitsya ahari nabi Samueli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:21">1 Sam 10:21</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 10:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baashaba omugabe; Ruhanga yaabaha Saulo mutabani wa Kiishi, ow'omuruganda rwa Benyamiini, yaabategyekyera emyaka makumi ana. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:20">Zab 89:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa 44:28</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">1 Sam 16:12</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo ku yaamwihireho, yaayemeka Daudi kuba omugabe waabo, ou yaahamize, naagira ati: Mboine Daudi mutabani wa Yese, omuntu ori nk'omutima gwangye oku gurikwenda; aryakora byona ebi ndikukunda. <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>. </char></note> Omu ruzaaro rw'omushaija ogwo, nimwo Ruhanga yaihiire Israeli Omujuni, Yesu, nk'oku yaaraganiise. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesu ogwo atakaizire, Yohaana akabuurira Abaisraeli boona okubatizibwa okw'okweteisa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoh 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yohaana ku yaabaire naamariiriza orugyendo rwe, yaagira ati: Nimugira ngu, mba oha? Nyowe tindi We. Kwonka hariho orikwija enyima yangye, ou ntashemereire kuyuzya enkaito ze.<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />B'eishe-emwe, abaana b'oruganda rwa Abrahamu, n'abari omuriimwe abarikutiina Ruhanga, ekigambo ky'okujunwa oku niitwe kyatumirweho. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:17">Byak 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu n'abategyeki baabo, ahabw'okutamumanya, n'obu kwakuba okushoborokyerwa ebyagambirwe baanabi, ebirikushomwa buri Sabato, bakabihikiiriza, obu baamusingisa orubanja. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kandi n'obu baraabe baabuzire orubanja rw'okumwitsa, bakashaba Pilaato ngu aitwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ku baaherize kuhikiiriza byona ebyamuhandiikirweho, baamuhanura aha muti, baamuziika omu kituuro. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kwonka Ruhanga yaamuzoora omu bafu; <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />yaamara ebiro bingi naareebwa abo abaarugire nawe Galilaaya nibaza Yerusaalemu; nibo baakareebi abarikumuhamya hati omu bantu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Naitwe tubareeteire ebigambo birungi eby'endagaano, ei Ruhanga yaaraganiise baatatenkuriitwe, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Zab 2:7</ref>. </char></note> kandi endagaano egyo akagihikiiriza ahariitwe, abaana baabo, obu yaazoora Yesu; nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omuri zaaburi eya kabiri ngu, Ori Omwana wangye, eri izooba naakuzaara. <verse eid="ACT 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku yaamuzoire omu bafu okutagaruka mu kujunda, akagira ati: Ndyabaha emigisha erikwera kandi etahwaho eya Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Zab 16:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi akagambira n'omuri zaaburi endiijo ati: Toriikiriza Orikwera waawe kujunda. <verse eid="ACT 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Nimumanya Daudi ku yaaherize kuhikiiriza enaama ya Ruhanga omu biro bye, yaagwejegyera, yaaziikwa na baishenkuru, yaajunda; <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />kwonka Ogwo ou Ruhanga yaazoire tarajunzire.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:43">Byak 10:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, mumanye ngu ahabw'Omushaija ogwo okwihwaho ebibi nikubagambirwa; <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:1">Rom 5:1</ref>. </char></note> kandi ahabw'Ogwo orikwikiriza weena naihwaho orubanja rw'ebibi byona, ebi mutaakubaasize kwihwaho Biragiro bya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu mwerinde, mutakaahikwaho ekyagambirwe baanabi, nibagira bati: <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Imwe abagaya, mureebe, mutangaare, muhweho; ahakuba ninkora omurimo omu biro byanyu, omurimo ogu mutariikiriza na kakye, n'obu omuntu yaakuba naagubashobororera.<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ku baabaire nibashohora, abantu baayeshengyereza ngu ebigambo ebyo bagarukye babigambirwe ahari Sabato erikwija. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ku baaherize kushohora, Abayudaaya baingi n'abahindukiire omu diini yaabo baakuratira Paulo na Barunaba; bo baabeehanangiriza nibabagambira kugumizamu omu mbabazi za Ruhanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okwanga okujunwa na Paulo okuhindukira Abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ahari Sabato egyo ab'omu rurembo haihi boona baateerana kuhurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Kwonka Abayudaaya ku baareebire emitwe y'abantu, baagira eihari ringi, baahakanisa ebigambo ebyagambirwe Paulo, baamujuma. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:30">Luk 7:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">Byak 18:6</ref>. </char></note> Paulo na Barunaba baagamba n'obumanzi, bati: Kikaba kishemereire kuba niimwe mwabanza kugambirwa ekigambo kya Ruhanga; mbwenu obu mwakyanga, mukeeyoreka ku mutashemereire magara agatahwaho, reeba twahindukira Abanyamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Mukama waitu nikwo yaturagiira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">Nkutaireho kuba Omushana gw'Abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">Ngu otware okujunwa, okuhitsya aha muheru gw'ensi.<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:18">Byak 11:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamahanga ku baakihuriire, baashemererwa, baahimbisa ekigambo kya Ruhanga; boona abatooraniirwe amagara agatahwaho baikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ekigambo kya Mukama kyabuga omu nsi egyo yoona. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kwonka Abayudaaya baayosya abakazi abanyadiini ab'ekitiinisa n'abashaija bakuru ab'omu rurembo, baahiiga Paulo na Barunaba, baababinga omu ishaza ryabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka bo baabakunkumurira omucuucu gw'omu bigyere byabo, baaza Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Abeegi baijura okushemererwa n'Omwoyo Orikwera.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Aba Ikonio okubinga Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ku baahikire Ikonio, baataaha omuri sinagogi y'Abayudaaya, baagamba ebigambo birungi ebyareeteire omutwe gw'Abayudaaya n'Abagriika baingi okwikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:45">Byak 13:45</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abayudaaya, abaayangire kuhurira, baayosya Abanyamahanga, baashiisha emitima yaabo ngu bangye ab'eishe-emwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:11">Byak 19:11</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho baamarayo ebiro bingi, nibagamba n'obumanzi, beegamiire Mukama, owaahamize ekigambo ky'embabazi ze n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza ebi yaabahaire kukora n'emikono yaabo. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Kwonka ab'omu rurembo baayebaganisamu; abamwe baaza aha rubaju rw'Abayudaaya, abandi aha rw'entumwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:11">2 Tim 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abanyamahanga n'Abayudaaya baacuma enaama y'okubakora kubi n'okubaitsa amabaare; <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:23">Mat 10:23</ref>. </char></note> entumwa ku zaakimanyire, zaahungira Lusitura na Derube, tauni za Lukaonia, n'ebyanga ebihikaine n'aho; <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />okwo baabuurirayo engiri.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okukiza ekirema Lusitura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Omuri Lusitura hakaba harimu omushaija, owaabaire atarikubaasa kugyendesa maguru, owaazairwe ari ekirema, otakagyendahoga. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:4">Byak 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo yaahurira Paulo naagamba. Paulo, ku yaamwetegyereize, yaareeba ku aine okwesiga ngu naabaasa kutambirwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, ati: Imuka, oyemerere n'ebigyere byawe. Yaabandatuka, yaagyenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ab'emitwe ku baareebire eki Paulo yaakora, baayombera ahaiguru, nibagamba omu rurimi rwa Lukaonia, bati: Baaruhanga baatushuumamu omu nshusha y'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Barunaba baamweta Zeu, na Paulo baamweta Herume, ahabw'okuba niwe yaabaire ari mukuru omu kugamba. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Omunyamurwa wa hekalu ya Zeu, eyaabaire eri omu maisho g'orurembo, yaareeta ente n'ebishaba by'ebirabyo aha irembo, yaija n'abantu kutamba ekitambo. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Kwonka entumwa, Barunaba na Paulo, ku baahuriire ekyo, baataagura ebijwaro byabo, baayeshuka omu bantu, nibagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:17">Yer 32:17</ref>. </char></note> Bashaija 'mwe, n'enki ekirikubakoresa ebyo? Naitwe turi abantu-buntu nkaimwe, twabareetera ebigambo ebirungi, ngu murekye ebi ebitaine mugasho, muhindukire Ruhanga ohuriire, owaahangire eiguru n'ensi n'enyanja n'ebintu byona ebirimu. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:30">Byak 17:30</ref>. </char></note> Omu busingye bwa ira akareka amahanga goona kugyendera omu mihanda yaago. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Kwonka tararekyeire aho kubura eky'okumuhamya, ahakuba akaguma naabakora gye, naabagwisiza enjura okuruga omu iguru, naabeereza emyaka omu bunaku bwayo, naabahaazya eby'okurya, naijuza emitima yaanyu okushemererwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Batyo baazibira abantu kubatambira ebitambo n'ebigambo ebyo, kwonka kyabarusya munonga.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuteerwa amabaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 3:11">2 Tim 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima haija Abayudaaya abaarugire Antiokia na Ikonio; ku baaherize kwosya abantu, baateera Paulo amabaare, baamukurura nibamushohoza aheeru y'orurembo, nibagira ngu afiire. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kwonka abeegi ku baayemereire bamwehinguririize, yaimuka, yaagaruka omu rurembo; ku bwaseesire, yaashohora na Barunaba, baaza Derube. <verse eid="ACT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ku baaherize kubuurira engiri ab'omuri tauni egyo n'okuhindura abeegi baingi, baagaruka Lusitura na Ikonio na Antiokia <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:3">1 Tes 3:3</ref>. </char></note> nibagumya emitima y'abeegi, nibabeehanangiriza kuguma omu kwikiriza, kandi bati: Tushemereire kutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga, nituraba omu busaasi bwingi. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:3">Byak 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku baaherize kubateeraho abakuru omuri buri kanisa, nibashaba nibeesiibyakwo, baabatsigira Mukama ou baikiriize. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Bwanyima baaraba omuri Pisidia, baahika Pamfulia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Ku baaherize kugamba ekigambo omuri Peruga, baashuuma, baataaha Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Omu kurugayo baaza omu meeri, baahika Antiokia, ahu baatsigiriirwe embabazi za Ruhanga ahabw'omurimo, ogu baaheza kuhikiiriza. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:18">Byak 11:18</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikireyo, baateerana ekanisa yoona, baabateekyerereza byona ebi Ruhanga yaakozire hamwe nabo, kandi n'oku yaiguriire Abanyamahanga orwigi rw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Baagumayo n'abeegi ebiro bitari bikye.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Empaka z'eby'okusharwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:2">Gal 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima haija abashaija bamwe abaarugire Buyudaaya, baayegyesa ab'eishe-emwe bati: Ku muraabe mutashazirwe nk'omugyenzo gwa Musa oku guri, timurikubaasa kujunwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:1">Gal 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Paulo na Barunaba baahakanisa abantu abo munonga, baahika n'aha kutongana; ab'eishe-emwe nikwo kwohereza Paulo na Barunaba n'abandi bamwe aharibo kwinamuka Yerusaalemu aha ntumwa n'abakuru, ngu babamare empaka ahari ekyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />N'ahabw'ekyo abo, ku baaherize kushendekyerezibwa ab'ekanisa, baaraba omuri Foiniike na Samaria, nibagambira ab'eishe-emwe eby'okuhinduka kw'Abanyamahanga, byareetera boona okushemererwa kwingi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ku baahikire Yerusaalemu, baayakiirwa ab'ekanisa n'entumwa n'abakuru, baabateekyerereza byona ebi Ruhanga yaakozire hamwe nabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Kwonka haayemerera bamwe ab'omu kigombe ky'Abafarisaayo abaikiriize, baagira bati: Ekirikwetengwa n'okubashara, kandi n'okubaragiira okuhitsya Ebiragiro bya Musa.<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura okwabaire Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Entumwa n'abakuru baateerana hamwe kuteekateeka aha kigambo ekyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Byak 10:44</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize omwanya muhango nibahanuura, Petero yaayemerera, yaabagira ati: B'eishe-emwe, nimumanya ngu omu biro byahweire Ruhanga akantoorana omuriimwe kuba niinye naagambira Abanyamahanga ekigambo ky'engiri, ngu bakihurire, baikirize. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Kandi Ruhanga orikumanya emitima yaabahamya, naabaha Omwoyo Orikwera nk'oku yaamutuhaire; <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />tiyaatutaansia nabo, yaashemeze emitima yaabo ahabw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:1">Gal 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nimugyereza ki Ruhanga okwekoreza abeegi emitwaro ei baatatenkuriitwe batarabaasize kwekorera, n'obu baakuba itwe? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:4-10">Efe 2:4-10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka itwe nitwikiriza ngu turyajunwa ahabw'embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu, nk'abo oku barikunwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Abantu boona baacureera, baahurira Barunaba na Paulo nibabateekyerereza obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza ebi Ruhanga yaabakoreise omu Banyamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:18">Byak 21:18</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kugamba, Yakobo yaagira ati: B'eishe-emwe, mumpurire! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simooni yaaheza kubateekyerereza oku Ruhanga yaatandikire kutaayaayira Abanyamahanga okutoorana abantu omuribo kuba eihanga eririkwetererwa eiziina rye. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Kandi ebigambo bya baanabi nibiikirizana nabyo, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Bwanyima y'ebyo ndyagaruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Nyimutsye enju ya Daudi eyaagwire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ahu yaasheenyukire ndyahashemeza, mpaimutsye,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Ngu abantu abaahonokireho basherure Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Hamwe n'Abanyamahanga boona abarikwetererwa eiziina ryangye;<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Nikwo Mukama arikugira, okora ebyo byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:18">Ebyamanyirwe okuruga iranaira.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo nindagiira nti: Turekye kurusya abarikuruga omu Banyamahanga bakahindukira Ruhanga; <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Kut 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Lev 17:10-16</ref>. </char></note> kwonka tubahandiikire, barekye kweshiisha n'okuramya ebishushani, n'eshagama. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ahakuba okuruga ira Musa aine omu ndembo zoona abarikumugambaho, kandi buri Sabato ebitabo bye bishomerwa omuri sinagogi.<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebaruha eyahandiikiirwe Abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Bwanyima entumwa n'abakuru hamwe n'ekanisa yoona baasiima kutoorana omuribo abashaija ab'okutuma na Paulo na Barunaba omuri Antiokia. Baatuma Yuda orikwetwa Barusaba na Siila, abantu bakuru omu b'eishe-emwe; <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />baahandiika ebaruha, baagibaha, ehandiikirwe eti: Itwe entumwa n'ab'eishe-emwe abakuru nitubahandiikira imwe ab'eishe-emwe ab'omu Banyamahanga abari Antiokia na Siria na Kilikia, nitubaramutysa. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tukahurirangu bamwe abaarugire omuriitwe bakabagambira ebigambo by'okubeemereza emitima n'okubabanganisisa, haza tutarabaragiire. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />N'ahabw'ekyo ku twateeraine, twasiimira hamwe kutoorana abashaija n'okubabatumaho hamwe na Barunaba na Paulo, abu turikukunda, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />abashaija abaayogire amagara gaabo ahabw'eiziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Mbwenu abu twatuma ni Yuda na Siila, nibo baraabashobororere ebigambo ebyo n'akanwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:4">Mat 23:4</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu Omwoyo Orikwera naitwe twasiima kutabakorera gundi mutwaro oguremeire kureka okwikiriza ebi ebibashemereire, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />okureka kurya ebihongyeirwe ebishushani, n'eshagama, n'ebinigirwe, n'obushambani; ku muraayerinde ebyo, muryaguma muri gye. Mugumeho.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebaruha okuhika Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ku baaherize kuragwa, baashuuma, baaza Antiokia. Ku baahikireyo, baateerana ab'omutwe boona, baabaha ebaruha. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ku baagishomire, baashemererwa ahabw'okuhuumurizibwa okwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Kandi Yuda na Siila, ahabw'okuba nabo bakaba bari baanabi, baayehanangiriza ab'eishe-emwe n'ebigambo bingi, baabagumya. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ku baamazireyo ebiro ebitari bikye, baaragwa n'obusingye ab'eishe-emwe kugaruka ahari abo abaabatumire. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Kwonka Siila we yaasiima kutsigarayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Kandi Paulo na Barunaba nabo baaguma Antiokia, nibeegyesa, nibabuurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga hamwe n'abandi baingi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Orugyendo rwa Paulo orwa kabiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 3:5">1 Tes 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro ku byahingwireho, Paulo yaagira Barunaba ati: Ka tugarukyeyo hati, tutaayaayire ab'eishe-emwe ab'omu ndembo zoona, ei twagambire ekigambo kya Mukama, tureebe oku bari. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barunaba akaba naakunda ngu bagyende na Yohaana orikwetwa Mako; <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Byak 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Paulo tiyaasiima kugyenda n'omuntu owaataaniire nabo Pamfulia, obu yaayanga kugyendanabo aha murimo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Haabaho empaka nyingi, ahabw'ekyo baataana; Barunaba yaatwara Mako, baaza omu meeri, baayambuka Kupuro. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Paulo we yaatoorana Siila; ab'eishe-emwe ku baaherize kumutsigira embabazi za Mukama, yaagyenda. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Yaaraba omuri Siria na Kilikia, naagumya amakanisa.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Timoseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:22">Byak 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:5">2 Tim 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:19-22">Fil 2:19-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaahika Derube na Lusitura; okwo hakaba hariyo omwegi orikwetwa Timoseo, mutabani w'Omuyudaayakazi owaikiriize, kwonka ishe akaba ari Omugriika. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoseo ogwo akaba asiimwa ab'eishe-emwe aba Lusitura na Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo yaayenda ngu bagyendane; yaamutwara, yaamushara ahabw'Abayudaaya abaabaire bari omu myanya egyo; ahakuba boona bakaba nibamanya ngu ishe n'Omugriika. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ku baabaire nibaraba omuri tauni ezo, baabaha ebiragiro ebyatairweho entumwa n'abakuru abaabaire bateeraniire Yerusaalemu, ngu babikwate. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo amakanisa gaagumibwa omu kwikiriza, abantu baayeyongyera kukanya obutoosha.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okwetwa kuza Makedonia omuri Bulaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ku baazibiirwe Omwoyo Orikwera kugamba ekigambo omuri Asia, baaraba omu byanga bya Furugia na Galatia; <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />ku baahikire haihi na Musia, baayenda ngu baze Bisunia; kwonka Omwoyo wa Yesu tiyaabaikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Batyo baaraba Musia, baashuuma baahika Troa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Nyekiro Paulo yaayorekwa, yaareeba omushaija owa Makedonia, ayemereire, naamweshengyereza ati: Yambuka, oije Makedonia, otuhwere. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ku yaareebire okworekwa okwo, ahonaaho twayenda kuza Makedonia, twahamiza kimwe ngu Ruhanga atwetsire kubabuurira engiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo twaruga Troa omu meeri, twagyema ogurikwambuka Samoserakia; aha izooba erindi twahika Neapooli; <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />ku twarugireyo, twahika Filipi, orurembo orukuru orwa Makedonia, orwayombekirwe Abarooma abaafurukiireyo; twamara ebiro omu rurembo orwo. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Aha izooba rya Sabato twashohora twaraba omu irembo ryarwo, twaza aha rubaju rw'omugyera, ahu twateekateekire ngu hariho omwanya gw'okushabiramu; twashutama ahansi, twagamba n'abakazi abaateeraniireyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:44">Yoh 6:44</ref>. </char></note> Omuri abo hakaba harimu omukazi orikwetwa Ludia, omushuubuzi w'emyenda ya bujwa, ow'omuri tauni eya Suatira, owaabaire atiina Ruhanga; ku yaatuhuriire, Mukama yaigura omutima gwe okweta aha bigambo ebyagambwa Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ku yaaherize kubatizibwa n'ab'omu ka ye, yaatweshengyereza, naagira ati: Ku muraabe mwansiima ngu ndi omwesigwa ahari Mukama, mwije omu nju yangye, mucumbikyemu. Yaatugyemesereza.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okukiza omuzaana oriho daimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ku twabaire nituza omuri ogwo mwanya gw'okushabiramu, twabuganwa omuzaana oriho daimoni orikuragura, owaabaire atungisa bakama be munonga n'emikimbo ei yaabaire akimbirwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mak 1:24</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Omuzaana ogwo yaakuratira Paulo naitwe, naayamuza n'eiraka rihango ati: Abashaija aba n'abahuuku ba Ruhanga Rukira-boona; nibabamanyisa omuhanda gw'okujunwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:13">Byak 19:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaaguma naakora atyo ebiro bingi. Paulo, ku yaatamirwe, yaahinduka, yaagira daimoni ati: Ninkuragiira omu iziina rya Yesu Kristo, murugyeho. Daimoni yaamurugaho omuri ako kaanya.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubohwa kwa Paulo na Siila, n'okuhinduka kw'omuserukare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bakama be ku baareebire baahwa amatsiko g'okumutungaho ebintu, baakwata Paulo na Siila, baabakurura, baabatwara omu katare omu maisho g'abategyeki; <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />ku baabahikize abaramuzi, baagira bati: Abashaija aba n'Abayudaaya, nibarabanisamu orurembo rwaitu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Nibeegyesa emicwe ei ebiragiro bituzibira kwikiriza n'obu kwakuba okukora, ahakuba turi Abarooma. <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:25">2 Kor 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:2">1 Tes 2:2</ref>. </char></note> N'abaabaire bateeraniire aho baabaimukiririra hamwe; n'abaramuzi baabataagurira ebijwaro aha mibiri, baaragiira kubateeza enkoni. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ku baaherize kubateera enkoni nyingi, baabaroha omu kihome, baaragiira omurinzi w'embohe kubarinda munonga. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ku yaaragiirwe atyo, yaabatsindika omu kishengye kya hagati eky'omu kihome, yaaboha amaguru gaabo omu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enkomo nizo mpimbi ezi babohesa amaguru g'embohe. </char></note>nkomo.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Nyekiro nk'omu itumbi Paulo na Siila bakaba nibashaba, nibeeshongorera Ruhanga, n'embohe zibategire amatu; <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />omu mwanya ogwo haabaho omutsitsa mwingi, omusingi gw'ekihome gwatengyetsibwa; ahonaaho enyigi zoona zaiguka, n'emihama ya buri muntu yaakomoroka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Omurinzi w'ekihome ku yaasisiimukire, yaareeba enyigi ziigukire, yaasyorayo rurara ye, yaayenda kwerezya, ahabw'okuba akateekateeka ngu embohe zicwire. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Kwonka Paulo yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Oteekora kubi, ahakuba twena turi aha. <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Yaatuma amatabaaza, yaayetuura omu nju, yaajuumara omu maisho ga Paulo na Siila, naatetema aine obwoba; <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:37">Byak 2:37</ref>. </char></note> yaabashohoza aheeru, yaababuuza ati: Baataata, nshemereire kukora ki, nkajunwa? <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Baagarukamu bati: Ikiriza Mukama waitu Yesu, noija kujunwa, iwe n'eka yaawe. <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Kandi baamugambira ekigambo kya Mukama hamwe na boona abaabaire bari omu ka ye. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Yaabatwara omu shaaha egyo nyekiro, yaabanaabisa emihiriirizi; ahonaaho yaabatizibwa n'ab'omu ka ye boona. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Bwanyima yaabatwara omu nju ye, yaabareetera eby'okurya, ashemereirwe munonga n'ab'omu nju ye ahabw'okwikiriza Ruhanga.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ku bwaseesire, abaramuzi baatuma abaserukare, nibagira bati: Murekure abashaija abo. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Omurinzi w'embohe yaagambira Paulo ebigambo ebyo, ati: Abaramuzi baatuma ngu tubarekure; mbwenu hati mushohore, mugyende n'obusingye. <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:25">Byak 22:25</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Paulo yaabagira ati: Batuteereire omu maisho g'abantu tutakacwereirwe rubanja, haza turi Abarooma; kandi baaturoha omu kihome; mbwenu nibenda kutwihamu kitamanyirwe? Ngaaha! Reka, babe nibo baija, batweshohoreze. <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Abo baserukare baagambira abaramuzi ebigambo ebyo; ku baahuriire ngu n'Abarooma, baatiina. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:34">Mat 8:34</ref>. </char></note> Baija, baabeehohoora; ku baabashohoize, baabashaba kuruga omu rurembo. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Batyo baaruga omu kihome, baataaha omu nju ya Ludia; ku baareebaine n'ab'eishe-emwe, baabagumya, baarugayo.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubingwa Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ku baarabire omuri Amfipooli na Apolonia, baahika Tesalonika; aho hakaba hariho sinagogi y'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulo, nk'omucwe gwe oku gwabaire guri, yaabataahamu, yaabahakanisa omu Byahandiikirwe okumara amazooba ashatu ga Sabato, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:45">Luk 24:45</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:46">46</ref>. </char></note> naashoboorora, kandi naahamya ku Kristo yaashemereire kubonabonesibwa, n'okuzooka omu bafu; kandi ati: Yesu ogwo, ou ndikubagambira, niwe Kristo buzima. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Abamwe aharibo baikiriza, baakwatanisa na Paulo na Siila; kandi haikiriza omutwe muhango gw'Abagriika abanyadiini, n'abakazi b'ekitiinisa abatari bakye. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kwonka Abayudaaya bo baakwatwa eihari, baatwara abashaija babi b'ebizengyerezi, baateerana omutwe muhango, baateerera orwari omu rurembo; baakuba enju ya Yasooni, nibenda kushohoza Paulo na Siila, ngu babareete omu maisho g'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:20">Byak 16:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku baababuriire, baakurura Yasooni n'abamwe aha b'eishe-emwe, baabatwara omu maisho g'abategyeki b'orurembo, nibagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: Abashaija aba abajuumikire ensi, mbwenu baizire n'aha; <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:2">Luk 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:21">Rom 16:21</ref>. </char></note> na Yasooni yaabaakiira; haza boona nibagomera ebiragiro bya Kaisaari, nibagira ngu hariho omugabe ondiijo, Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Omutwe gw'abantu n'abategyeki b'orurembo, ku baabihuriire, baayemereza emitima. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ku baaherize kwiha ahari Yasooni n'abandi omusingo, baabarekura.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubingwa Beroya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ahonaaho ab'eishe-emwe baayohereza Paulo na Siila nyekiro ngu bataahe Beroya. Ku baahikireyo, baaza omuri sinagogi y'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:39">Yoh 5:39</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abo bo bakaba batwaza gye okukira aba Tesalonika, ahabw'okuba bakaakiira ekigambo n'emitima erikukundira kimwe, nibashwijuma omu Byahandiikirwe obutoosha, kureeba ebigambo ebyo ku biraabe nikwo biri. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo baingi aharibo baikiriza, n'Abagriikakazi ab'ekitiinisa n'abashaija abatari bakye. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kwonka Abayudaaya ba Tesalonika ku baamanyire ngu Paulo agambire ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'omuri Beroya, nayo baazayo, baayosya abantu, baabajagaraza emitima. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ahonaaho ab'eishe-emwe baayohereza Paulo kugyenda ngu ahikye aha nyanja; Siila na Timoseo baatsigarayo. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Abaashendekyereize Paulo baamuhitsya Aseene; ku yaaherize kubaragiira kugambira Siila na Timoseo ngu beehuute bamushangyeyo, baagyenda.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubuurira engiri Aseene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulo ku yaabaire akibategyerereize Aseene, omutima gwe gwashaasha munonga ahabw'okureeba orurembo rwijwire ebishushani ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Atyo yaahakanisa Abayudaaya n'abanyadiini omuri sinagogi, kandi n'omu katare yaahakana n'abu yaabaire ashangamu obutoosha. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Kandi bamwe aha banyabwengye Abaepikureyo n'Abastoyiko baamubugana. Abamwe baagira bati: Mbwenu reero naayenda kugamba ki, egi ngambi y'amaingi? Abandi bati: Naashusha nk'orikugamba ebya baaruhanga abasya; ahakuba akaba naagamba ebya Yesu n'eby'okuzooka. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Baamukwata, baamutwara Areopaago, nibagira bati: Nitwenda kumanya eby'okwegyesa oku okusya, oku orikugamba, oku kuri. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ahakuba oreetsire ebigambo bisya omu matu gaitu; nikyo turikwendera kumanya amakuru gaabyo. <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Kandi aba Aseene boona n'abagyenyi abaabaire bariyo bakaba batakiine kindi eki barikukora kureka okugamba, n'okuhurira ebigambo bisya ebihangire.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Paulo nikwo kwemerera ahagati ya Areopaago, akagira ati: Imwe abashaija ba Aseene, ndeebire omuri byona ku murengyesereize okuba abanyadiini. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ahakuba ku mbaire nimpingura, naareeba ebi murikuramya, naashanga eitambiro erihandiikirweho ngu, N'ERYA RUHANGA OTARIKUMANYWA. Haza mbwenu eki muramya nk'ekitarikumanywa, nikyo ndikwenda kubagambira. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:48">Byak 7:48</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga owaahangire ensi n'ebintu byona ebirimu, ahabw'okuba Mukama w'eiguru n'ensi, tatuura muri hekalu ezombekirwe n'emikono, <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:12">Zab 50:12</ref>. </char></note> n'obu kwakuba okuheerezibwa emikono y'abantu, nk'oine eki akyenire; ahakuba niwe wenka aha abantu boona amagara n'omwitsyo na buri kintu kyona; <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:8">Bir 32:8</ref>. </char></note> kandi akahanga amahanga goona ag'abantu, naabakomoora aha muntu omwe, ngu batuure omu nsi yoona. Niwe yaataireho obunaku bw'emyaka okwihaihana, akataho emyatano y'ahu abantu batwire; <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:6">Isa 55:6</ref>. </char></note> ngu babone kusherura Ruhanga, nibabandagira baine amatsiko g'okumugwaho, n'obu araabe atari hare n'omuntu weena omuriitwe; <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />ahakuba omuriwe tuba abahuriire, tugyenda, kandi tugumaho; nk'abamwe aha bahimbi baanyu b'ebyoshongoro oku baagambire nibagira bati: Ahakuba naitwe turi oruzaaro rwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:18">Isa 40:18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:26">Byak 19:26</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ku turaabe turi oruzaaro rwa Ruhanga, titushemereire kuteekateeka ngu Ruhanga naashusha ezaabu nari efeeza, nari amabaare agasharwire omu buringaringo n'obwengye bw'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:16">Byak 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:23">17:23</ref>. </char></note> Ebiro ebyo eby'okutamanya, Ruhanga akabirenzya amaisho, kwonka hati naaragiira abantu boona abari hoona kweteisa, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:8">Zab 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:42">Byak 10:42</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba akataho ekiro eki aricweraho emanja z'ensi yoona omu kuhikiirira, naazicwisa Omuntu ou yaatooraine; kandi ebyo akabihamiza abantu boona, obu yaamuzoora omu bafu.<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ku baahuriire aha by'okuzooka omu bafu, abamwe baabishekyerera, abandi baagira bati: Turyakuhurira obundi, obitugambire. <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Atyo Paulo yaabarugaho. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kwonka abashaija bamwe baaguma nawe, baikiriza; omuribo hakaba harimu Dionisio ow'omu ba Areopaago, n'omukazi orikweta Damari, hamwe n'abandi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuza Korinso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo yaaruga Aseene yaaza Korinso. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:3">Rom 16:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaashangayo Omuyudaaya orikwetwa Akula, enzoorwa ya Pontio, nibwo yaabaire arugire Italia n'omukazi we Priskila, ahabw'okuba Kulaudio akaba aragiire Abayudaaya boona kuruga Rooma. Paulo yaaza owaabo kubareeba; <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:34">Byak 20:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:12">1 Kor 4:12</ref>. </char></note> kandi, ahabw'okushangwa ari ow'omwoga gumwe n'ogwabo, yaaguma nabo, nibakora hamwe; ahakuba omwoga gwabo gukaba guri okubaziira amahema. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Buri Sabato yaaguma naahakanisa Abayudaaya n'Abagriika omuri sinagogi, naabaikiririsa. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Siila na Timoseo ku baarugire Makedonia, Paulo yaagyemwa ekigambo kya Ruhanga, naahamiza Abayudaaya ku Yesu ari Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:46">Byak 13:46</ref>. </char></note> Ku baamuhakaniise munonga, baarogota, yaakunkumura ebijwaro bye, yaabagira ati: Eshagama yaanyu ebe niimwe yaatukururira; nyowe ndi mwere; okuruga hati niinyija kuza omu Banyamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Yaarugayo, yaataaha omu nju y'omuntu orikwetwa Tito Yusito, owaabaire aramya Ruhanga, enju ye ekaba eri haihi na sinagogi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Kor 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Krispo omukuru wa sinagogi yaikiriza Mukama n'eka ye yoona; n'aba Korinso baingi, ku baahuriire, baikiriza, baabatizibwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Mukama waitu yaagambira Paulo nyekiro omu kworekwa ati: Otatiina, ogume ogambe, orekye kuhunama; <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:10">Isa 41:10</ref>; <ref loc="JON 4:11">Yon 4:11</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe, kandi tihariho muntu oraakutaahirire kukukora kubi; ahakuba nyine abantu baingi omu rurembo oru. <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Bwanyima yaamarayo omwaka n'ameezi mukaaga, naabeegyesamu ekigambo kya Ruhanga.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okutabaariza Paulo ahari Galio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Galio ku yaabaire ari omutegyeki wa Akaya, Abayudaaya baimukirira Paulo n'omutima gumwe, baamutwara omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'eiramuriro; <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />nibagira bati: Omushaija ogu naikiririsa abantu kuramya Ruhanga omu buryo oburikuhakanisa Ebiragiro. <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:18-20">Byak 25:18-20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Paulo ku yaabaire naayenda kwashamya akanwa ke kwetonganira, Galio yaagambira Abayudaaya ati: Imwe Bayudaaya 'mwe, kuri ruri orubanja rw'ekibi nari shi ekihagaro, nkaagizire oburyo bw'okubagumisiririza, mbahurira; <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:31">Yoh 18:31</ref>. </char></note> kwonka obu ziri empaka z'ebigambo n'amazima n'ebiragiro byanyu mwenka, mubyemarire; tindikwenda kucwa orubanja rw'ebigambo nk'ebyo. <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Yaababinga omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'eiramuriro. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:1">1 Kor 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Boona baakwata Soseene, omukuru wa sinagogi, baamuteerera omu maisho g'ekyo kitebe. Kwonka ebyo byona Galio tiyaabyetaho.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugaruka Antiokia, n'okutandika orugyendo rwa kashatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Kub 6:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Paulo yaamarayo ebindi biro bingi; ku byahweire, yaaraga ab'eishe-emwe, yaaza omu meeri na Priskila na Akula, baayambuka Siria; ku yaahikire Kenkereya, yaamweisa eishokye, ahakuba nikwo yaabaire arahiire. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ku baahikire Efeso, yaabatsigayo; yaataaha omuri sinagogi wenka, yaahakansia Abayudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ku baamushabire kuguma nabo ebiro ebindi, tiyaabaikiriza; <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:15">Yak 4:15</ref>. </char></note> kwonka yaabaraga naagira ati: Ruhanga ku arikunda, ndyagaruka. Atyo yaaza omu meeri, yaaruga Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ku yaayambukire Kaisarea, yainamuka, yaaramutsya ekanisa; bwanyima yaaza Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ku yaamazireyo ebiro, yaarugayo, yaaraba omu mashaza ga Galatia na Furugia, naareeba emyanya yaamwo nk'oku yaabaire ekurataine, naagumya abeegi boona.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Apolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:6">1 Kor 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hakaba hariho Omuyudaaya orikwetwa Apolo, enzaarwa ya Alegizanderia, omushaija orikumanya kugamba, kandi owaabaire ari omunyabwengye omu Byahandiikirwe; yaija Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:3">Byak 19:3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:11">Rom 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:15">Kush 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ogwo akaba ayegyesiibwe omuhanda gwa Mukama; kandi ahabw'okwezirika omu Mwoyo, yaagamba ebya Yesu, naabeegyesa gye, n'obu araabe yaabaire naamanya okubatiza kwa Yohaana kwonka. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Yaatandika kubuurira n'obumanzi omuri sinagogi. Kwonka Priskila na Akula, ku baamuhuriire, baamutwara owaabo, baayongyera kumushobororera gye omuhanda gwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:1">2 Kor 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaateekateekire kwambuka Akaya, ab'eishe-emwe baamugumya, baahandiikira abeegi kumwakiira; ku yaahikireyo, embabazi za Ruhanga zaamubaasisa kuhwera abo abaabaire baikiriize; <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />ahakuba akaba ahakanisa Abayudaaya n'amaani omu maisho ga boona, abasinga, naabahamiza omu Byahandiikirwe ku Yesu ari Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Abeegi ba Yohaana Omubatizi okwijura Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolo ku yaabaire akiri Korinso, Paulo yaaraba omu kyanga kya ruguru, yaahika Efeso, yaashangayo abeegi bamwe; <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />yaababuuza ati: Obu mwaikiriza, mukaheebwa Omwoyo Orikwera? Baamugarukamu bati: Ngaaha, n'okuhurira titukahuriraga, yaaba habaho Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Yaagira ati: Mukabatizibwa omu kubatizibwa ki? Bati: Omu kubatiza kwa Yohaana. <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Paulo yaagira ati: Yohaana akabatiza okubatiza kw'okweteisa, naagambira abantu kwikiriza Ogwo orikwenda kwija enyima ye, niwe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ku baahuriire ekyo, baabatizibwa omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:17">Byak 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10:44</ref>. </char></note> Paulo ku yaabataireho engaro, Omwoyo Orikwera yaabaijaho; baagamba endimi ezindi, baaragura. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Boona bakaba bari ikumi na babiri.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okukora eby'okutangaaza omuri Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Yaataaha omuri sinagogi, yaamara ameezi ashatu naagamba n'obumanzi, naahakanisa abantu, kandi naabaikiririsa eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kwonka bamwe ku baagangaize emitima, baayanga kuhurira nibajuma Omuhanda ogwo omu maisho g'abantu, yaabarugaho, yaashorooramu abeegi, yaaguma naahakanira omu ishomero rya Turaano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Yaagumizamu naakora atyo okumara emyaka ebiri; n'ahabw'ekyo boona abaabaire batwire Asia, Abayudaaya n'Abagriika, baahurira ekigambo kya Mukama. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Ruhanga yaakoresa emikono ya Paulo eby'okutangaaza ebitari by'obutoosha; <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />kandi ebitambaara n'emyenda ebyarugire aha mubiri gwe baabitwarira abarwaire, baakira endwara zaabo, n'abariho baadaimoni baabarugaho.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:49">Luk 9:49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakaba hariho ebizengyerezi by'Abayudaaya, abatsiriki b'emizimu, baayehanga kutsirika baadaimoni omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu, nibagira bati: Ninkwitsa Yesu ou Paulo agamba. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Hakaba hariho abashaija mushanju, batabani ba Skewa Omuyudaaya, omunyamurwa omukuru, abaabaire nibakora batyo. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:41">Luk 4:41</ref>. </char></note> Daimoni yaabagarukamu ati: Yesu nimmumanya, na Paulo nimmumanya; beitu imwe muri baahi? <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Omushaija owaabaire ariho daimoni yaabagurukira boona, yaabakiza amaani, yaababinga, baahunga omu nju egyo bajwaire busha, bahutaire. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:5">Byak 5:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 5:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekyo kyamanywa boona, Abayudaaya n'Abagriika, abaabire batwiire Efeso; boona baatiina munonga, kandi eiziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu ryahimbisibwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Kandi baingi ahari abo abaikiriize baija, baayatura ebibi byabo, baagamba n'ebi baakozire. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Baingi ahari abo, abaabaire bakora eby'obufumu baateeranira hamwe ebitabo byabo eby'okuragura, baabyokyeza omu maisho g'abantu boona; baabariirira obuguzi bwabyo, baashanga nibuhika ebicweka by'efeeza obukumi butaano. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Okwo nikwo ekigambo kya Mukama kyayeyongyeire kityo amaani, kikasingura. <verse eid="ACT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:11">Byak 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rom 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebyo ku byahweire, Paulo yaamariirira omu mutima gwe kubanza kuraba Makedonia na Akaya, ngu abone kuza Yerusaalemu, naagira ati: Ku ndiba naahikireyo, nshemereire kuza kureeba Rooma nayo. <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:14">Byak 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kutuma Makedonia babiri aha bahwezi be, Timoseo na Erasto, we yaaguma Asia ebiro bikye.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaheesi ba Efeso okurwanisa ebya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:9">Byak 19:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo hakabaho okujagarara kwingi ahabw'eby'Omuhanda ogwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ahakuba omushaija orikwetwa Demeterio, omuheesi w'efeeza, owaabaire aheesha ebishushani bya hekalu ya Atemi omu feeza, naatungisa abaheesi be munonga; <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />akabateerana hamwe n'abandi abaabaire bakora omwoga ogwo, yaabagira ati: Bashaija 'mwe, nimumanya omwoga ogu ku nigwo gubaire nigututungisa. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mbwenu nimureeba, kandi nimuhurira ku kitari muri Efeso yonka, kureka n'omuri Asia haihi yoona, Paulo ogwo ayohize abantu baingi, naabahindura, naagira ati: Baaruhanga abakozirwe n'emikono, ti baaruhanga b'amazima. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Mbwenu nu hariho akabi, ti habw'omwoga gwaitu kugaywa kwonka, kureka n'ahabwa hekalu na ruhangakazi rugambwa Atemi kuhindurwa busha; kandi na ruhanga-kazi ogwo, orikuramibwa ab'omu nsi zoona, kwihwaho ekitiinisa kye.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ku baahuriire ekyo, baakwatwa ekiniga kingi, baayomba munonga bati: Atemi wa Efeso ni mukuru! <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Byak 20:4</ref>. </char></note> Orurembo rwona rwayoogoorekana; abantu baakwata Gaayo na Aristariiko aba Makedonia, abaabaire bagyenda na Paulo omu ngyendo ze, boona baashutuka, baaza omu izaaniro. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo yaayenda kubataahamu, kwonka abeegi be tibaamwikiriza; <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />kandi bamwe aha bakungu bakuru ba Asia, abaabaire bari banywani be, baamutumaho, baamweshengyereza ngu arekye kweroha omu iteeraniro. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ab'omu mutwe ogwo abamwe baayomba okwabo, n'abandi okwabo, ahakuba boona bakaba nibayoogoorekana, kandi abaingi batamanyire ekyabateerana. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Baiha Alegizanda omu mutwe, Abayudaaya baaba nibo baamwebembeza. Alegizanda yaabacureeza n'omukono, ngu abone kwetonganira aha bantu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kwonka ku baamanyire ku ari Omuyudaaya, boona baayombera hamwe okumara nk'eshaaha ibiri nibagira bati: Atemi wa Efeso ni mukuru! <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Bwanyima omuhandiiki omukuru ow'omu rurembo yaacureeza abantu naagira ati: Imwe bashaija ba Efeso 'mwe, ni muntu ki otarikumanya ngu orurembo rwa Efeso nirwo rurinda hekalu ya Atemi omukuru, n'ekishushani ekyarugire omu iguru? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Mbwenu, nk'oku hatariho orikubaasa kubyehakana, mushemereire kuhunama, mutakora ekintu kyona nimurahukiriza. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ahakuba abashaija abo tibaibire by'omuri hekalu zaitu, n'obu kwakuba okurogota ahari ruhanga-kazi waitu; mbwenu mwabareeta aha. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />N'ahabw'ekyo Demeterio n'abaheesi bagyenzi be, ku baraabe baine eki barikutabaariza omuntu weena, amaramuriro gariho, n'abategyeki bariho; babe niyo baatabaarizana. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Kwonka ku muraabe mwine ekindi eki murikushobooroza, biryamarirwa omu ishengyero ry'obutoosha. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Mumanye ku turi omu kabi k'okuregwa ahabw'okuyoogoorekana kw'eri izooba; ahakuba tihariho buryo obu turaayetonganire bukashoboorora okuteerana oku. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ku yaaherize kugamba ekyo, yaagambira abantu, baayabuuka.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuraba omuri Bugriika okuhika Troa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Okurabanamu ku kwahweireho, Paulo yaatuma abeegi; ku yaaherize kubagumya, yaabaraga, yaarugayo kuza Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ku yaaherize kuraba omu bicweka ebyo, n'okubagumya omuri bingi, yaahika Bugriika. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Okwo yaamarayo ameezi ashatu; ku yaabaire naayenda kugyendera omu meeri kuza Siria, Abayudaaya baacuma enaama y'okumwita; n'ahabw'ekyo yaamariirira kugaruka ogwa Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:21">Rom 16:21</ref>. </char></note> Abaagyenzire nawe kumuhitsya Asia ni Sopateera owa Beroya, mwene Puuro, Aristariiko na Sekundo aba Tesalonika, Gaayo owa Derube, na Timoseo, Tukiko na Trofimo aba Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Abo baatwebembera, baatutegyerereza Troa; <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />kwonka itwe, bwanyima y'ebiro by'Emigaati etatumbisiibwe, twaruga Filipi, twaza omu meeri, twabashanga Troa, tumazire ebiro bitaano; okwo twamarayo ebiro mushanju.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzoora Yutuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:2">1 Kor 16:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro ky'okubanza omu saabiiti, ku twabaire tuteeraine hamwe kubega omugaati, Paulo yaabagaaniirira, naayenda kurugayo omu kasheeshe; yaagumizamu naagamba okuhitsya omu itumbi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Omuri kanyinaishatu omu twabaire tuteeraniire, hakaba harimu amatabaaza maingi; <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />kandi omutsigazi orikwetwa Yutuko akaba ashutami omu dirisa; yaagira oturo twingi; Paulo ku yaagumiizemu naagamba, Yutuko ogwo yaarembibwa oturo, yaahanantuka omuri kanyinaishatu, yaagwa ahansi, baamwihaho akabire. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:21">1 Bag 17:21</ref>. </char></note> Paulo yaashuuma, yaamwinamaho, yaamubumbatira, naagira ati: Mutacura, ahakuba akihuriire. <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Paulo yaagaruka yaatemba, yaabega omugaati, yaarya, bwanyima yaagumizamu naagaaniira nabo omwanya muhango okuhitsya omu kasheeshe; atyo yaagyenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Omutsigazi ogwo baamwihayo ahuriire, baagarukwa emitima omunda.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugumizamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Itwe twayebembera kuza aha meeri, twagizamu, twayambuka Asosi, ei twayenzire ngu twakiirire Paulo; ahakuba akaba aturagiire atyo, ngu we arabe ogw'ebigyere. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ku yaatubugaine Asosi, twamutaasya omu meeri, twaija Mituleene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ku twarugireyo, omu kasheeshe twahika aharikureeba Kio; aha kiro kya kashatu twahika Samo; aha kiro kya kana twahika Mileeto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulo akaba amaririire kuhingura Efeso ari omu meeri, ngu atakyerererwa Asia; ahabw'okuba akaba naayehuuta ngu, ku kiraabe nikibaasika, ekiro kya Pentekoote kimushangye Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuraga abakuru ba Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ku yaabaire ari Mileeto, yaatuma omuri Efeso kwetayo abakuru b'ekanisa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ku baamuhikireho, yaabagira ati: Imwe nimumanya oku naatwire naimwe ebiro byona okuruga aha izooba eri naahikiireho omuri Asia; <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />nkaba nkorera Mukama n'obucureezi bwingi nindira, omu by'okugyezibwa ebyambaireho ahabw'enaama mbi z'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Nimumanya ku ntaratiinire kubagambira kigambo kyona eky'omugasho, nimbeegyeseza omu maisho ga boona, kandi n'omu maju gaanyu emwe-emwe, <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />nimpamiza Abayudaaya n'Abagriika okweteisiza Ruhanga, n'okwikiriza Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Kandi mbwenu, reeba niinyinamuka Yerusaalemu, ngyemirwe Omwoyo, ntarikumanya birambeho naahikayo; <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:4">Byak 21:4</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 21:11">11</ref>. </char></note> kureka Omwoyo Orikwera nammanyisiza omuri buri tauni ku okubohwa n'okubonabonesibwa bintegyerereizeyo. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:13">Byak 21:13</ref>. </char></note> Tindikuteekateeka ha magara gangye nk'ekintu kikuru eky'obuguzi; eki ndikwenda ni kimwe, n'okuheza orugyendo rwangye n'obuheereza obu naahairwe Mukama waitu Yesu, bw'okuhamya engiri y'embabazi za Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Hati mbwenu nimmanya ngu imwe mwena abu naabaire ndabamu nimbuurira eby'obukama, timurindeeba bundi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:6">Byak 18:6</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikuhamiza omu maisho gaanyu mwena nti: Ndi mwere aha by'eshagama y'abantu boona; <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />ahakuba tindatiinire kubagambira naama yoona eya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:2">1 Pet 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Imwe mwerinde, kandi murinde n'obusyo bwona obu Omwoyo Orikwera yaabakwatsize kuba abareeberezi baabwo, okuriisa ekanisa ya Ruhanga ei yaayeguriire n'eshagama ye. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mat 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:16">10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:12">Yoh 10:12</ref>. </char></note> Nimmanya ngu, ku ndiheza kubarugaho, emishega eshuugire eryabataahirira, terisaasira busyo; <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:19">1 Yoh 2:19</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'omuriimwe haryarugamu abantu, abarikugamba eby'obuhabe, niboosya abeegi ngu babakurate. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />N'ahabw'ekyo mugume nimureeba, kandi mwijukye ku ntararekire kuhana muntu weena n'amarira, okumara emyaka eshatu nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Kandi na hati mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, nimbatsigira Ruhanga n'ekigambo ky'embabazi ze, ekirikubaasa kubombeka n'okubaha obuhunguzi hamwe na boona abeeziibwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:3">1 Sam 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Tindeetengire feeza y'omuntu weena, n'obu eraabe ezaabu, n'obu kyakuba eky'okujwara. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:9">1 Tes 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Imwe mwena nimumanya ngu emikono yangye egi nimwo naabaire nyiha eby'okuntunga n'abu naabaire nyine. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Omuri byona mbabeereire eky'okureeberaho, ngu mubone kukora mutyo emirimo, kuhwera abataine maani, n'okwijuka ebigambo ebi Mukama waitu Yesu yaagambire naagira ati: Okugaba kuhaisa omugisha okukira okuheebwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:5">Byak 21:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaatsimba amaju, yaashaba hamwe nabo boona. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Boona baarira munonga, baagwa Paulo omu bitsya, baamunywegyera, <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />nibashaasha, n'okukira byona ahabw'ekigambo eki yaabaragisa, ati: Amaisho n'aga. Baamushendekyereza okuhika aha meeri.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Abeegi okuteisa Paulo okutaza Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ku twataine nabo, twaza omu meeri, twagyema ogurikuza Koosi; ku bwaseesire, twahika Roodo; twarugayo twahika Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ku twashangire emeeri neeyenda kuza Foiniike, twagizamu, twagyenda. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ku twarangiza Kupuro, twagitsiga aha rubaju rwa bumosho, twaza Siria, twahika aha nkungu ya Tuuro, ahakuba niho baabaire nibaza kuteekururira ebintu omu meeri. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ku twareebire abeegi, twamarayo ebiro mushanju. Abo baateisa Paulo nibagambisibwa Omwoyo, kutaza Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ku twamazireyo ebyo biro, twarugayo, twahamya orugyendo rwaitu; boona hamwe n'abakazi baabo n'abaana baatushendekyereza, okuhitsya obu baatwogize omu rurembo; ku twahikire aha nyanja, twatsimba amaju, twashaba, twaragana. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ku twataahire omu meeri, baagaruka owaabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ku twaherize orugyendo rw'okuruga Tuuro, twahika Potolemai; twaramutsya ab'eishe-emwe, twaraarayo nabo. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Byak 8:40</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, twarugayo, twahika Kaisarea; twataaha omu nju ya Filipo omubuurizi w'engiri, owaabaire ari omwe ahari bari badiikoni mushanju, twaguma owe. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Kandi akaba aine abaishiki bana b'empangare, abaabaire baragura. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Byak 11:28</ref>. </char></note> Ku twagumireyo ebiro bingi, haija omushaija nabi, orikwetwa Agabo, naaruga Buyudaaya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ku yaatuhikire, yaakwata orukoba rwa Paulo, yaarwekomesa ebigyere n'emikono, yaagira ati: Oku nikwo Omwoyo Orikwera arikugira ati: Abayudaaya ba Yerusaalemu nikwo barikoma mukama w'orukoba oru, bakamuhayo omu mikono y'Abanyamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:22">Mat 16:22</ref>. </char></note> Ku twahuriire ekyo, itwe n'abantu baayo twamweshengyereza ngu arekye kwinamuka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Paulo yaagarukamu ati: Nimukora ki okurira n'okuncwa omutima? Mumanye ngu tiinyeteekateekire kuboherwa Yerusaalemu kwonka, kureka n'okufeerayo ahabw'eiziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Ku yaayangire kutuhurira, twarereera, twagira tuti: Eki Mukama arikwenda kibe nikyo kyakorwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuhika Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Bwanyima y'ebiro ebyo twakoma ebyaitu, twainamuka Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />n'abeegi bamwe aba Kaisarea baagyenda naitwe, baija n'omwegi owa ira orikwetwa Munasooni owa Kupuro, owaabaire naayenda kuturaaza. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ku twahikire Yerusaalemu, ab'eishe-emwe baatwakiira n'okushemererwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:13">Byak 15:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, Paulo yaagyenda naitwe owa Yakobo; kandi abakuru boona bakaba bari aho. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ku yaaherize kubaramutsya, yaabateekyerereza byona buri kimwe, ebi Ruhanga yaakozire omu Banyamahanga omu kuheereza kwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:1">Byak 15:1</ref>. </char></note> Nabo ku baabihuriire, baahimbisa Ruhanga. Bwanyima baamugira bati: Ow'eishe-emwe, oreebire omu Bayudaaya ku harimu abantu enkumi n'enkumi abaikiriize; boona baine obweziriki ahabw'Ebiragiro; <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:3">Byak 16:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi boona bakagambirwa ebyawe ngu oyegyesa Abayudaaya boona abaatwire omu Banyamahanga kureka ebya Musa, kandi obagambira ngu barekye kushara abaana baabo, n'okukwata emigyenzo y'ediini yaabo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Mbwenu tugire tuta? Ahakuba tibaribura kuhurira ku oizire. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo kora eki turikukugambira. Aha twineho abashaija bana abaayerahiriire endahiro; <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:18">Byak 18:18</ref>. </char></note> obatware, oyeyeze hamwe nabo, obaihurire ebi bacwereirwe, babone kumwa eishokye aha mitwe yaabo. Mbwenu boona nibaija kumanya ngu ebi baagambiirwe ahariiwe n'ebishuba, ahakuba naiwe wenka oyerinda, kandi oyorobera Ebiragiro. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Kandi eby'Abanyamahanga abaikiriize, tukabahandiikira ebaruha, nitubaragiira kwerinda ebihongyirwe ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, n'eshagama, n'ebinigirwe, n'obushambani. <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:20">1 Kor 9:20</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Paulo yaatwara abashaija abo; ku bwaseesire, yaayeyeza nabo, yaataaha nabo omuri hekalu, yaaranga ahu ebiro by'okwezibwa birihwera, ku nibwo ekitambo kya buri omwe kiriheebwayo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaserukare b'Abarooma okukiza Paulo Abayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ebiro ebyo mushanju ku byabaire biri haihi kuhwa, Abayudaaya abaarugire Asia, ku baamureebire omuri hekalu, baajagaraza omutwe gwona ogw'abantu, baamuyookyera, baamukwata, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:7">Ezk 44:7</ref>. </char></note> baayomba nibagira bati: Imwe bashaija Baisraeli 'mwe, nimutuhwere! Omushaija ogu niwe ayegyesa abantu boona hoonahoona kugaya eihanga ryaitu, n'Ebiragiro, n'omwanya ogu; kandi areetsire Abagriika omuri hekalu, yaashiisha omwanya ogu ogurikwera. <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Tim 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba bakaba bahereerukire kumureeba omu rurembo na Trofimo owa Efeso, baateekateeka ngu Paulo amureetsire omuri hekalu. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Orurembo rwona rwatengatenga, abantu baayooka, baakwata Paulo, baamukurura omuri hekalu; ahonaaho enyigi zaakingwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ku baabaire nibenda kumwita, enkuru yaahika aha mukuru w'engabo, ngu Yerusaalemu yoona neerabanamu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ahonaaho yaahurura n'abaserukare n'abakuru baabo, yaabashuumira nairuka; bo, ku baamureebire n'abaserukare, baarekyeraho kuteera Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Omukuru w'engabo yairira haihi, yaakwata Paulo, yaaragiira kumukomesa enjegyere ibiri; bwanyima yaamubuuza eiziina rye, n'eki akozire. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Abamwe aha b'omu mutwe baayomba okwabo, n'abandi okwabo; ku yaareebire ataabaasa kushoborokyerwa amazima ahabw'okuyomba, yaaragiira kumutwara omu kigo ky'abaserukare. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ku yaahikire aha matembero, abaserukare baamukiriza ahabw'ekiniga ky'abantu; <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:18">Luk 23:18</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba omutwe gw'abantu gukamukuratira niguyomba munonga nigugira guti: Mumwiheho! <verse eid="ACT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Paulo, ku yaabaire ari haihi kutaaha omu kigo, yaashaba omukuru w'engabo ati: Nkaagira eki naagamba? Yaamubuuza ati: Noomanya Orugriika? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Tori Omunyamisri ori owaagomeise abantu omu biro bihingwire, akatwara omu ihamba abashaija enkumi ina abaitsi b'abantu? <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi Omuyudaaya owa Taruso ey'omuri Kilikia, ow'omu rurembo orutarikugaywa; ninkweshengyereza, onyikirize ngambire aba bantu. <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ku yaamwikiriize, Paulo yaayemerera aha matembero, yaacureeza abantu n'omukono; ku haabaireho okucureera kwingi yaabagambira omu Ruheburaayo ati:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetonganira kwa Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Beene waitu kandi Baataata, muhurire ebigambo ebi ndikwetonganira omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ku baahuriire yaabagambira omu Ruheburaayo, baayeyongyera kucureera. Yaagira ati: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-29">Byak 9:1-29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-20">26:9-20</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe ndi Omuyudaaya; nkazaarirwa Taruso ey'omuri Kilikia, kwonka naakurira omu rurembo oru, nintendekwa Gamalieli, niinyegyesibwa munonga kukuratira emigyenzo y'ebiragiro bya baatatenkuriitwe, nyine obweziriki ahari Ruhanga, nkaimwe oku mubwine hati; <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />kandi nkaba mpiiga ab'Omuhanda ogu ngu baitwe, nimboha abashaija n'abakazi, nimbataisa omu kihome. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />N'omunyamurwa omukuru niwe kareebi wangye, hamwe n'abakuru b'eishengyero boona; nibo bampaire ebaruha ezi baahandikiire beene waitu aba Damasiko, ntwairweyo okukwata abaayo n'okubareeta Yerusaalemu babohirwe, ngu baheebwe ekiheneso.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Ku naabaire ningyenda, naahika haihi na Damasiko, nk'omu ihangwe ahonaaho naayakirwa omushana mwingi niguruga omu iguru gwanyehinguririza. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Naagwa ahansi, naahurira eiraka niringira riti: Saulo, Saulo, ompiigira ki? <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Naagarukamu nti: Ori oha, Mukama wangye? Yangira ati: Niinye Yesu owa Nazareesi, ou orikuhiiga. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Abu naabaire ngyenzire nabo baareeba omushana ogwo, kwonka tibaahurira iraka ry'ogwo owaabaire naagamba naanye. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Naabuuza nti: Ngire nta, Mukama wangye? Mukama yangarukamu ati: Imuka oze Damasiko; niyo oraagambirirwe byona ebi oragiirwe kukora. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Okumurinkana kw'omushana ogwo kwampumya; n'ahabw'ekyo naakwatirirwa abo abu naabaire nyine, naahika Damasiko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Omushaija orikwetwa Anania, omunyadiini omu Biragiro, orikusiimwa Abayudaaya boona abaabaire batwire okwo, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />yaija, yaanyemerera aha rubaju, yangambira ati: ow'eishe-emwe Saulo, humuuka. Omu kaanya ako naahumuuka, naamureeba. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Yaagira ati: Ruhanga wa baatatenkuriitwe akutooraine ngu omanye ebi akunda, oreebe Ogwo Ohikiriire, kandi ohurire eiraka eririkuruga omu kanwa ke. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ahakuba oryaba kareebi we ow'okuhamiza abantu boona ebi oreebire n'ebi ohuriire. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Mbwenu otegyereize ki? Imuka, obatizibwe, oyogye ebibi byawe, otakire eiziina rye.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:18">Gal 1:18</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 1:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naagaruka Yerusaalemu; ku naabaire ndi omuri hekalu ninshaba, naashusha nk'orikuroota, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />naamureeba yangira ati: Otakyerererwa; rahuka orugye Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba tibarikwija kwikiriza okuhamya oku orikumpamya. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Naanye naagira nti: Mukama wangye, bo bonka nibamanya ngu nkaba nkwata abarikukwikiriza, mbata omu bihome, kandi mbateerera omuri sinagogi zoona; <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Byak 7:58</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:1">8:1</ref>. </char></note> kandi obu baajwisa eshagama ya Stefano kareebi waawe, nkaba nyemereireho nimbisiima, ndinzire n'ebijwaro byabo abaamwitsire. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Byak 9:15</ref>. </char></note> Yangambira ati: Irooko, ahakuba niinyija kukutuma hare omu Banyamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okushaba ngu aitwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Baaguma bamuhurikiize okuhitsya obu yaagambire ekigambo ekyo; okuruga aho baayomba munonga nibagira bati: Mwihe omu nsi ekishaija ekyo; tikishemereire kugumaho. <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ku baabaire nibayomba munonga, nibatambika emyenda yaabo, kandi nibanaga n'omucuucu ahaiguru, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />omukuru w'engabo yaaragiira kumutaasya omu kigo, n'okumwasha nibamutatsya, ngu abone kwetegyereza eki baamuteererera enduuru. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:37">Byak 16:37</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kumubohesa enkoba, Paulo yaabuuza omukuru w'abaserukare owaabaire ayemereire haihi, ati: Ebiragiro nibibaikiriza kwasha omuntu Omurooma, atakacwereirwe rubanja? <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Omukuru ogwo, ku yaakihuriire, yaaza aha mukuru w'engabo, yaamugira ati: Nooyenda kukora ki? Ahakuba omushaija ogu n'Omurooma. <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Omukuru w'engabo yaija, yaamubuuza ati: Ngambira; ori Omurooma? Paulo ati: Eego. <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Omukuru w'engabo yaagira ati: Nyowe nkatunga Oburooma obu n'empiiha nyingi. Paulo ati: Kwonka nyowe nibwo naazairwemu. <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Ahonaaho abo abaabaire nibenda kumutatsya baamurugaho; kandi omukuru w'engabo nawe yaatiina, ahabw'okumanya ku Paulo ari Omurooma, kandi yaamubohire.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ku bwaseesire, yaayenda kumanya amazima g'ekigambo eki Abayudaaya bamutabaaririize, yaamubohoorora, yaaragiira abanyamurwa abakuru n'ab'eishengyero boona kuteeranira hamwe, yaashuumya Paulo, yaamuta omu maisho gaabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okwetonganira omu maisho g'eishengyero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 24:16">Byak 24:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Paulo yaahamya amaisho ab'eishengyero, yaagira ati: Beene waitu, ntuura nyine omutima ogutarikunshinja kibi omu maisho ga Ruhanga n'okuhitsya eri izooba. <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:22">Yoh 18:22</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa omukuru orikwetwa Anania yaaragiira abamwemereire haihi kumuteera omunwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10-15">Ezk 13:10-15</ref>. </char></note> Paulo yaamugira ati: Ruhanga aryakuteera naiwe, iwe kisiika ekisiigirwe einoni 'we! Waashutama kuncwera orubanja nk'Ebiragiro oku biri; kandi waaragiira kunteera omu buryo oburikubihenda? <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Abeemereire haihi baagira bati: Okaajumire omunyamurwa wa Ruhanga omukuru? <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>. </char></note> Paulo yaagira ati: Beene waitu, naaba ntamanyire ku ari omunyamurwa omukuru; ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: Otarijuma omutegyeki w'eihanga ryanyu.<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:2">Byak 4:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Paulo ku yaayetegyereize ngu ekicweka ekimwe n'eky'Abasadukaayo, ekindi n'eky'Abafarisaayo, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango omu ishengyero ati: Beene waitu, ndi Omufarisaayo, kandi omwana w'Abafarisaayo; nincwerwa orubanja ababw'okuturwa amatsiko agu nyine aha kuzooka kw'abafu. <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, haabaho okutongana kw'Abafarisaayo n'Abasadukaayo; eishengyero ryayebaganisamu habiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat 22:23</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abasadukaayo bagira ngu tihariho kuzooka, n'obu yaakuba maraika, n'obu gwakuba omuzimu; kwonka Abafarisaayo bo babiikiriza byona. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Haabaho okuyoogoorekana kwingi; abamwe ab'omu kigombe ky'abahandiiki b'Abafarisaayo baayemerera, baahakana nibagira bati: Tihariho kibi eki twareeba aha mushaija ogu. Shana omwoyo nari maraika akaaba amugambiire? <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Empaka zaabo ku zaabire ez'amaani maingi munonga, omukuru w'engabo yaatiina ngu baaza kutaanyagura Paulo, nikwo kuragiira abaserukare kushuuma kumubaihamu n'amaani, n'okumureeta omu kigo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Byak 19:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba nyekiro Mukama yaamwemerera aha rubaju, yaamugira ati: Guma omutima ahakuba, nk'oku wampamize ori Yerusaalemu, nikwo oshemereire kumpamya n'omuri Rooma.<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okuhiga kwita Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ku bwaseesire, Abayudaaya baateeranira hamwe, baahiga nibarahira okutarya n'obu kwakuba okunywa okuhitsya obu baraite Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Abaacumire egyo naama bakaba nibakira makumi ana. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Baaza aha banyamurwa abakuru n'abakuru b'abantu, baabagira bati: Turahiire endahiro mpango munonga kutaroza ha by'okurya, okuhitsya obu turaite Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo imwe n'ab'eishengyero mugambire omukuru w'engabo hati, amubashuumize, nk'abarikwenda kwongyera kwetegyerereza kimwe eby'orubanja rwe; itwe tweteekateekire kumwita, atakabahikire. <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Kwonka mwihwa wa Paulo yaahurira enaama yaabo ey'okumugwera, yaagyenda yaataaha omu kigo, yaakigambira Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Paulo nikwo kweta omwe aha bakuru b'abaserukare, akagira ati: Twara omutsigazi ogu, omuhitsye omukuru w'engabo; ahakuba aine eki arikwenda kumugambira. <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Yaamutwara, yaamuhitsya omukuru w'engabo, yaagira ati: Paulo embohe yaanyeta, yanshaba kukureetera omutsigazi ogu, ngu aine eki arikwenda kukugambira. <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Omukuru w'engabo yaamukwata omukono, yaamukiika aha rubaju, yaamubuuza omu mubonano ati: Nooyenda kungambira ki? <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Onu yaagira ati: Abayudaaya bacumire enaama emwe kukushaba, ngu nyencakare oshuumye Paulo omu ishengyero, nk'abarikwenda kwongyera kubuuza ebye. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Kwonka otabaikiriza; ahabw'okuba abashaija baabo abarikukira ahari makumi ana bamugwereire, kandi barahiire endahiro okutarya n'obu kwakuba okunywa batakamwitsire; mbwenu beeteekateekire, bategyereize ekigambo kyawe. <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Omukuru w'engabo yaaraga omutsigazi, naamwehanangiriza ati: Otagira ou waamanyisa ku waabingambira.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okucwisizibwa Kaisarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Atyo yaayeta abakuru b'abaserukare babiri, yaabaragiira ati: Muteekateekye abaserukare magana abiri n'ab'embaraasi makumi mushanju n'ab'amacumu magana abiri, baimukye eshaaha ishatu za nyekiro baze Kaisarea; <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />kandi yaabaragiira kusherura enyamaishwa ezirikuheeka kuheeka Paulo, babone kumuhitsya gye Felikisi omutegyeki. <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Yaahandiika n'ebaruha erikugira eti: <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Ow'ekitiinisa Felikisi Omutegyeki, nyowe Kulaudio Lusia ninkuramutsya munonga. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:25">Byak 22:25</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ogu akakwatwa Abayudaaya, baayenda kumwita; ku naamanyire ku ari Omurooma, naabaizira n'abaserukare, naamujuna. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Kandi ku naayenzire kwetegyereza ebi barikumutabaariza, naamureeta omu ishengyero ryabo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:14">Byak 18:14</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Naashanga atabaariziibwe ahabw'ebigambo by'omu biragiro byabo, kwonka rutari rubanja orw'okumwitsa n'obu kwakuba okumubohesa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ku naagambiirwe ku hariho enaama y'okumwita, ahonaaho naamukwoherereza, naaragiira n'abaamutabaariize okugambira omu maisho gaawe eki barikufa nawe.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Batyo abaserukare batwara Paulo, nk'oku baaragiirwe, baamuhitsya Antipatiri nyekiro. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ku bwaseesire, abaserukare baamutsigira ab'embaraasi kugumizamu nawe, bo baagaruka omu kigo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Kandi abo, ku baahikire Kaisarea, baahereza Omutegyeki ebaruha, baamumurikira na Paulo, <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Byak 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kugishoma, yaabuuza eishaza eri yaarugiremu; ku yaamanyire ngu n'owa Kilikia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />yaagira ati: Abaakutabaariize ku baraije, niinyija kuhurira orubanja rwawe. Yaaragiira kumurindira omu kikaari kya Heroode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okutabaariza Paulo omu maisho ga Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro bitaano, omunyamurwa omukuru Anania yaashuma n'abakuru b'abantu bamwe n'omushija orikwetwa Terituulo ow'okubatonganira. Batyo baatabaariza Paulo aha Mutegyeki. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Ku baamwetsire, Terituulo yaatandika kumutabaariza, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">Ow'ekitiinisa Felikisi, noomanya ngu obusingye obu bwona, obu turikwesiimiramu, niiwe burikurugaho, kandi n'ebindi ebi orikwezirika kukora kushemeza eihanga eri. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Ebyo nitubiikiriza omu buryo bwona n'omu myanya yoona, kandi nitubikusiimira munonga. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Kwonka, ka ndekye kwongyera kukurusya, ninkushaba ahabw'embabazi zaawe kutuhurira omu bigambo bikye. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:6">Byak 17:6</ref>. </char></note> Tukareeba omushaija ogu ku ari mubi munonga, naagomesa Abayudaaya baingi abari omu nsi zoona, kandi niwe mukuru omu kigombe ky'Abanazaraayo. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ekindi akateeraho kushiisha hekalu, twamukwata, twayenda ngu tumucwere orubanja nk'ebiragiro byaitu oku biri; <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />kwonka omukuru w'engabo Lusia yaija, yaamutwakisa amaani maingi, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />yaaragiira abaamutabaariize kwija ah'ori. Na mbwenu ku oraamubuuze, noija kumanya ebi byona ebi turikumutabaaririza. <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Abayudaaya nabo baakwatanisa nawe omuribyo, baahamya ku byona nikwo biri.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwetonganira kwa Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Omutegyeki ku yaamwikiriize kugamba, Paulo yaagarukamu ati: Nimmanya ngu omazire emyaka mingi ori omuramuzi w'eihanga eri; n'ahabw'ekyo naaza kwetonganira nshemereirwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:17">Byak 21:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku oraabuuze, noija kumanya ku mmazire ebiro ikumi na bibiri nyinamukire Yerusaalemu kuramya. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Tibaranshangire nimpakana n'omuntu weena, nari shi ninjagaraza abantu omuri hekalu nari omuri sinagogi nari omu rurembo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Kandi tibakaabaasa kukuhamiza ebi barikuntabaaririza hati. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Kwonka eki ndikwemera omu maisho gaawe n'eki: Omuhanda ogwo, ogu aba barikweta ekigombe, nigwo ngyederamu nimpeereza Ruhanga wa baatatenkuriitwe, niinyikiriza ebyahandiikirwe omu Biragiro n'omu bya Baanabi byona; <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />kandi nyine amatsiko ahari Ruhanga, nk'oku nabo barikwikiriza, ngu haryabaho okuzooka kw'abahikiriire n'abatahikiriire. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Omuri ebyo nyezirika obutoosha kuguma n'omutima ogutariho rubanja ahari Ruhanga n'aha bantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:25">Rom 15:25</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 15:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'emyaka mingi, nkaija ndeetsire empiiha z'okuhwera eihanga ryaitu n'eby'okuhonga. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Nkiri omuri ebyo, banshanga omuri hekalu nyeziibwe, ntaine mutwe gw'abantu abu nteeraine, n'obu rwakuba orwari. Kwonka hakaba hariho Abayudaaya bamwe abaarugire omuri Asia; <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />nangwa kuri nibo baizire omu maisho gaawe kuntabaariza, ku baraabe baine ekigambo ahariinye. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Nari shi reka abantu aba bagambe ekibi eki bandeebireho, obu naayemerera omu maisho g'eishengyero, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Byak 23:6</ref>. </char></note> okwihaho ekigambo kimwe eki naagambire butunu nyemereire ahagati yaabo nti: Okuzooka kw'abafu nikwo kuunyemereize omu rubanja omu maisho gaanyu eri izooba.<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Kwonka Felikisi, ahabw'okushoborokyerwa gye eby'Omuhanda ogwo, yaabooshesa, naagira ati: Lusia omukuru w'engabo ku ariija, nibwo ndicwa orubanja rwanyu. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:3">Byak 27:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaaragiira omukuru w'abaserukare kumurinda n'okumuha obusingye, n'okutazibira banywani be kumuhwera.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugamba engiri omu maisho ga Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro, Felikisi yaija n'omukazi we Durusila Omuyudaayakazi; yaayeta Paulo, yaahurira ebi arikugamba aha by'okwikiriza Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ku yaabaire naagamba aha by'okuhikiirira n'eby'okwerinda n'eby'orubanja oruriija, Felikisi yaatiina munonga, yaagira ati: Hati rekyera aho! Ku ndibona omwanya, ndyakweta. <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Kandi akaba aine amatsiko ngu Paulo aryamuha enguzi. Nikyo yaabaire amwetera kaingi kugaaniira nawe. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Kwonka ku haahingwireho emyaka ebiri, Felikisi yaahungurirwa Porokio Festo; kandi Felikisi, ahabw'okwenda kusiimwa Abayudaaya, yaatsiga Paulo omu kihome.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okwetonganira omu maisho ga Festo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Festo ku yaahikire omu butegyeki bwe, bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu yaaruga Kaisarea, yainamuka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Abanyamurwa abakuru n'abakuru b'Abayudaaya baamuregyera Paulo; <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:15">Byak 23:15</ref>. </char></note> baamweshengyereza nibamushaba ngu abakorere gye, amwete aije Yerusaalemu, babone kumugwera kumwitira omu muhanda. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kwonka Festo yaagarukamu ati: Paulo arindiirwe Kaisarea, kandi niinyenda kugarukayo juba. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: N'ahabw'ekyo abakuru omuriimwe bashuume tugyendane; omushaija ogwo ku araabe aine ekibi eki yaakozire, bamutabaarize. <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Ku yaamazire owaabo ebiro ebitarikukira ahari munaana nari ikumi, yaashuuma Kaisarea; ku bwaseesire, yaashutama aha kitebe ky'eiramuriro, yaaragiira kureeta Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ku yaizire, Abayudaaya abarugire Yerusaalemu baayemerera bamwehinguririize, nibamutabaariza emanja nyingi ez'eihano, ezi batarabaasize kuhamya mu mazima. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulo yaayetonganira ati: Tihariho kibi eki naakozire okushobya ebiragiro by'Abayudaaya, nari okushiisha hekalu, nari okugomera Kaisaari. <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Kwonka Festo, ku yaayenzire kusiimwa Abayudaaya, yaamubuuza ati: Nooyenda kwinamuka Yerusaalemu, ngu obe niyo waacwererwa emanja ezi omu maisho gangye? <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo yaagarukamu ati: Nyemereire omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'eiramuriro ekya Kaisaari; niho nshemereire kucwererwa orubanja. Aha Bayudaaya tihariho kibi eki naakozire, kandi naiwe nookimanya gye. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ku ndaabe nkozire kubi, nari shi nkozire ekishemereire kuunyitsa, tindikwanga kufa; kwonka omuri ebyo ebi barikuntabaariza, ku haraabe hatarimu na kimwe ekihikire, tihariho muntu orikubaasa kubampa. Ninjurira ahari Kaisaari. <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Festo, ku yaaherize kuhanuura n'ab'eishengyero rye, yaagira ati: Waajurira ahari Kaisaari; owa Kaisaari obe niyo waaza.<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Festo okuteekyerereza Aguripa ebya Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Bwanyima ku haahingwireho ebiro, Aguripa omugabe na Bereniike baahika Kaisarea, baaramutsya Festo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ku baamazireyo ebiro bingi, Festo yaateekyerereza omugabe orubanja rwa Paulo, naagira ati: Hariho omushaija ou Felikisi yaatsigire omu kihome. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ku naabaire ndi Yerusaalemu, abanyamurwa abakuru n'abakuru b'Abayudaaya banteekyerereza ebye, nibanshaba kumucwera orubanja. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Naabagarukamu nti: Timucwe gw'Abarooma kuhayo omuntu oregirwe, atakeemereire n'abarikumurega, akaheebwa omwanya gw'okwetonganira ebi bamuregire. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo ku baateeraniire aha, tinaabiraariza; ku bwaseesire, naashutama aha kitebe ky'eiramuriro, naaragiira kureeta ogwo mushaija. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Baakitabaaza ku baayemereire, tibaareeta rubanja rw'ebigambo bibi, nk'oku naabaire ninteekateeka; <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:15">Byak 18:15</ref>. </char></note> kureka baamutabaaririza empaka zimwe z'ediini yaabo, n'eby'omuntu orikwetwa Yesu owaafiire, ou Paulo arikuhamya ngu ariho ahuriire. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ku naashobeirwe, naabura kwetegyereza empaka ezo, naamubuuza ku araabe naayenda kwinamuka Yerusaalemu, n'okucwererwayo orubanja rw'ezo mpaka. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kwonka Paulo ku yaashabire kwemereza orubanja okuhitsya obu ruricuubwa Augusto, naaragiira ngu bamurinde, okuhitsya obu ndimwoherereza Kaisaari. <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:8">Luk 23:8</ref>. </char></note> Aguripa yaagambira Festo ati: Naanye nkaayenzire kuhurira omuntu ogwo. Festo yaagira ati: Omu kasheeshe noija kumuhurira.<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ku bwaseesire, Aguripa na Bereniike baija n'ekitiinisa kingi, baataaha omu iramuriro n'abakuru b'engabo n'abakungu b'orurembo. Festo yaaragiira ku bareeta Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:22">Byak 22:22</ref>. </char></note> Festo yaagira ati: Nyakusinga Aguripa naimwe mwena abari aha, mwareeba omushaija ogu ou omutwe gwona gw'Abayudaaya gwanshabiire Yerusaalemu n'aha, nibayomba munonga ngu tashemereire kugumaho. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Kwonka nkareeba atakozire kibi ekishemereire kumwitsa; kandi nawe ku yaajuriire ahari Augusto, naamariirira kumumutwekyera. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mbwenu mbuzire ekigambo kihikire ahariwe eky'okuhandiikira mukama wangye. Nikyo naamureetera omu maisho gaanyu, n'okukira munonga omu maisho gaawe, Nyakusinga Aguripa, ngu ku turaaheze kumutonganisa, mbone eky'okuhandiika. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ahakuba ninteekateeka ngu n'eky'obushema kwohereza embohe, haza ntoorekye rubanja rwe.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetonganira kwa Paulo omu maisho ga Aguripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Aguripa yaagambira Paulo ati: Noikirizibwa kwetonganira. Paulo yaimutsya omukono, yaayetonganira naagira ati:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />Nyakusinga Aguripa, naahiirwa ahakuba ebi naatabaariziibwe Abayudaaya byona niiwe naaza kubitonganaho; <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />kandi okukira munonga ahabw'okuba noomanyira kimwe emicwe yoona n'empaka zoona eby'Abayudaaya; n'ahabw'ekyo ninkweshengyereza ogumisirize ompurire.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Okwiha omu buto bwangye emicwe yangye, ei naakuriiremu omu ihanga ryaitu na Yerusaalemu, Abayudaaya boona nibagimanya. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga ira nibammanya, ku baakuba nibaikiriza kugamba, bakaahamya ku naabaire ndi Omufarisaayo ow'omu kicweka ekirikukira ebindi okuhitsya emigyenzo y'ediini yaitu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Mbwenu nyemereire aha kucwerwa orubanja ahabw'amatsiko ag'eki Ruhanga yaaraganiise baatatenkuriitwe; <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />kandi n'enganda zaitu ikumi na ibiri, ezirikwezirika kuheereza Ruhanga nyomushana na nyekiro, nazo nikyo zitegyereize kuhikaho. Kandi naanye, ahabw'amatsiko ago, nikyo ntabaaririziibwe Abayudaaya, Nyakusinga Aguripa! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />N'enki ekirikubateekateekyesa ekigambo eki ku kitarikubaasika Ruhanga kuzoora abafiire?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:1-29">Byak 9:1-29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:3-21">22:3-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naanye nkaba ninteekateeka buzima ku nshemereire kukora bingi kurwanisa eiziina rya Yesu owa Nazareesi. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />N'okukora nkabikora Yerusaalemu; naata abarikwera baingi omu bihome, mpairwe obushoboorozi abanyamurwa abakuru; t'ekyo kyonka, kandi n'abaabaire baitwa, nkaba nsiima ngu baitwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Kaingi omuri sinagogi zoona nkaba mbaha ebiheneso, mbagyemesereza kurogota; kandi ku naabaire mbagirira ekiniga kinshaza, mbahiiga nangwa n'okuhika mpika omu ndembo z'Abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Mbwenu ku naabaire ninza Damasiko nyine obushoboorozi n'obutumwa bw'abanyamurwa abakuru, <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Nyakusinga Omugabe, nkiri omu muhanda omu ihangwe, naareeba omushana niguruga omu iguru, nigumurinkana okukira eizooba, gwanjwera guunyehinguririize n'abo abu twagyendaine. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Ku twagwire ahansi twena, naahurira eiraka niringambira omu Ruheburaayo riti: Saulo, Saulo, ompiigira ki? Nooyerusya kuteera emigyere aha mihunda. <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Naamubuuza nti: Ori oha, Mukama wangye? Mukama waitu yaagira ati: Ndi Yesu ou orikuhiiga. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Kwonka imuka, oyemerere; ahakuba nikyo naakubonekyerera, ngu nkutoorane nkugire omuheereza na kareebi w'okuhamya ebi ebi wandeeberamu, n'ebindi ebi ndikweyorekyeramu; <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:7">Yer 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 1:8">8</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu nkujune omu ihanga eri n'omu Banyamahanga abu ndikutumamu, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:7">Isa 42:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 42:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:13">Kol 1:13</ref>. </char></note> okuhumuura amaisho gaabo, ngu bahindukye barugye omu mwirima, baze omu mushana, barugye omu bushoboorozi bwa Sitaane, bahindukire Ruhanga; babone kwihwaho ebibi, n'okuheebwa obuhunguzi hamwe n'abarikwezibwa ahabw'okuunyikiriza.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:16">Gal 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, Nyakusinga Aguripa, tindagomeire kworekwa okwo okw'omu iguru; <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />naatandikira aho kugambira aba Damasiko, bwanyima aba Yerusaalemu n'ab'omu ishaza ryona erya Buyudaaya, kandi n'Abanyamahanga, ngu beeteise, bahindukire Ruhanga, bakore ebishemereire okweteisa kwabo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Nikyo Abayudaaya bankwatiire ndi omuri hekalu, bakenda kuunyita. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:44-47">Luk 24:44-47</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ahabw'okuhwera kwa Ruhanga nkyemereire n'okuhitsya eri izooba, nimpamiza abato n'abakuru, ntaine kindi eki ndikugamba kureka ebi baanabi na Musa baaragwire ku biribaho; <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />bati: Kristo ashemereire kubonabonesibwa; kandi ahabw'okuba ow'okubanza kuzooka omu bafu, amanyise eihanga eri n'Abanyamahanga eby'omushana.<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuteeraho kwikiririsa Aguripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ku yaabaire naakyetonganira, Festo yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Paulo oshazire; obwengye bwawe bwingi bwaza kukugwisa eiraro. <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Kwonka Paulo yaagira ati: Ow'ekitiinisa Festo, tinshazire, kureka ningamba ebigambo by'amazima, ntarikurengyesereza. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:20">Yoh 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba n'omugabe naamanya ebigambo ebi; kandi nimbimugambira ntaine ki ndikwekyenga; nimmanyira kimwe ngu tihariho kigambo na kimwe omuri ebi eki atarikumanya; ahakuba tibirakozirwe bwesherekye. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Nyakusinga Omugabe Aguripa, noikiriza baanabi? Nimmanya ku orikwikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:16">1 Pet 4:16</ref>. </char></note> Aguripa yaamugarukamu ati: Iwe oyenzire kukirahutsya kumpindura, ngu mbe omukristaayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo yaagira ati: Ninshaba Ruhanga, yaaba mu kaanya kakye, nari shi kahango, tiiwe wenka, kureka na boona abampurira eri izooba bahindukye nkaanye, okwihaho eby'ezi njegyere.<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Omugabe yaimuka n'Omutegyeki na Bereniike n'abo abaabaire bashutami nabo; <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />ku baashohoire, baagambirana bati: Omuntu ogu takozire kibi ekishemereire kumwitsa nari okumubohesa. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Aguripa yaagira Festo ati: Omushaija ogu akaareekwirwe, kuri atarajuriire hari Kaisaari.<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okutwarwa Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ku baaherize kuturagiira kwambuka omu meeri kuza Italia, baahayo Paulo n'ezindi mbohe, baabakwatsa omukuru w'omutwe gw'abaserukare ogurikwetwa Omutwe gwa Augusto, eiziina rye Yulio. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Byak 19:29</ref>. </char></note> Twaza omu meeri ya Aduramutio, eyaabaire neeyenda kuraba aha nyambukiro za Asia, twagyenda omu nyanja, tushendekyereziibwe Aristariiko, Omunyamakedonia owa Tesalonika. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Aha kiro kya kabiri twahika Sidoni; okwo Yulio yaagirirayo gye Paulo, yaamwikiriza kutaayaayira banywani be n'okuruhuukaho. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Twarugayo, twaraba ahansi y'ekirwa kya Kupuro kwekingayo omuyaga, ahakuba gukaba gututurukire omu maisho. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ku twayambukire enyanja eri haihi na Kilikia na Pamufulia, twahika Mura, tauni ya Likia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Okwo omukuru w'abaserukare niyo yaashangire emeeri ya Alegizanderia, neeza Italia, akagitutamu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Twamara ebiro bingi nitugyenda mpora, twahika haihi na Kunido twaruhire; omuyaga ku gwatuzibiire kugumizamu, nikwo kugaruka ahansi y'ekirwa kya Kureete omu maisho ga Salumooni kugwekingaho. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Twakyekiikuura twaruhire, twahika aharikwetwa Nyambukiro-nungi haihi n'orurembo Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:25">2 Kor 11:25</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 11:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tutyo twakyerererwa omu rugyendo ebiro bingi, kandi n'akabi k'okuraba omu nyanja kaaba kaingi, ahakuba obwo ebiro by'Okwesiibyakwo bikaba byahingwire. Paulo yaabahabura naagira ati: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />Baataata, nindeeba ngu orugyendo oru nirwija kubamu okusiisikarirwa n'okufeerwa kwingi, ti kwa bintu n'emeeri byonka, kureka kandi n'amagara gaitu. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Kwonka omukuru w'abaserukare yaayeta aha bigambo by'omuvugi n'omukuru w'emeeri okukira ebya Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Ahabw'enyambukiro kutaba nungi kumariramu ebiro by'embeho, abaingi babahabura ngu ekirungi n'okurugayo bakagumizamu aha nyanja, ngu shana bakaahika Foinike enyambukiro y'omuri Kureete erikureeba ahagati y'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'oburugwa-izooba, n'ahagati y'obukiizi-bwa-buryo n'oburugwa-izooba, bamarirayo ebiro by'embeho.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eihunga okubateerera aha nyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Omuyaga ku gwahuuhire mpora nigwiha omu bukiizi-bwa-buryo, baateekateeka ngu baabona eki baaba nibenda; baakuura ekitsibo, baagyenda bakiikuuka Kureete haihi n'enkungu. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kwonka ku haahingwireho omwanya mukye, haija eihunga ry'amaani eririkwetwa Yurakuulo niriruga aha kirwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Emeeri yaayemerera, yaaremwa kugyema omu muyaga, nikwo kugireka, gukatutwara gwonka. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Twaraba ahansi y'akarwa akarikwetwa Kulauda, twayekingaho omuyaga, twabona kukomera akaato ak'enyima omu meeri, kwonka kyaturusya munonga. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ku baaherize kukahitsya omu meeri, baihayo emirunga, baagirabya ahansi y'emeeri, baagikoma, baagigumya. Bwanyima ku baatiinire kunagwa aha musheenyi ogurikwetwa Siruti, baahanura amatanga, baatwarwa batyo omuyaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ku twacurangiibwe eihunga munonga, aha kiro kya kabiri baatandika kunaga ebintu omu nyanja. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Aha kiro kya kashatu baanaga ebirikugyendesa emeeri n'emikono yaabo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ku twamazire ebiro bingi tutakireeba izooba n'obu zaakuba enyonyoozi, kandi eihunga ringi nirikituteera, amatsiko goona ag'okukira twagahwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubagumya emitima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ku baamazire omwanya muhango batarikurya, Paulo yaayemerera ahagati yaabo, yaagira ati: Baataata, mukaba mushemereire kumpurira kutaruga Kureete, kureeba okusiisiikarirwa oku, n'okufeerwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Mbwenu nimbagambira nti: Mugume emitima, ahabw'okuba tiharikwija kufa muntu n'omwe omuriimwe, kureka emeeri yonka. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ahakuba eki kiro haizire maraika wa Ruhanga, naanye ou ndi owe, kandi ou mpeereza, yaanyemerera aha rubaju; <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:11">Byak 23:11</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati: Paulo, otatiina; oshemereire kwemerera omu maisho ga Kaisaari; kandi reeba, Ruhanga akuhaire abo boona abarikugyenda naiwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Mbwenu, mugume emitima, bashaija 'mwe; ahakuba niinyesiga Ruhanga, ku kirikwija kuba nk'oku ngambiirwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Kwonka tushemereire kugira ekirwa eki twanagwaho.<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okusiisikara kw'emeeri, n'okukira kw'abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ekiro kya ikumi na bina kyahika nitucurangibwa omuyaga omu nyanja ya Aduria; omu itumbi abarimbi baateekateeka ngu bairiire haihi n'enkungu. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Baagyera oburaingwa bw'amaizi, baashanga ziri yaadi makumi ana; ku bairiire kakye omu maisho, baagaruka baagyera, baashanga ziri yaadi makumi ashatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ahabw'okutiina kweshekura aha nkiri, baashuumya ebitsibo bina enyima y'emeeri, nibenda ngu bubanze busheeshe. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Abarimbi baateeraho kuruga omu meeri ngu bahungye, baashuumya akaato omu nyanja, nibeeshushanisa nk'abarikwenda kushuumya ebitsibo omu maisho g'emeeri; <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Paulo yaagambira omukuru w'abaserukare n'abaserukare ati: Abo ku baraabe batagumire mu meeri, timurikubaasa kukira. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Abaserukare nikwo kushara emirunga y'akaato, bakakareka, kakagyenda.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ku bwabaire nibutaagurikana, Paulo yaabeeshengyereza boona kurya aha by'okurya, naagira ati: Eri izooba n'ekiro kya ikumi na bina nimusiibakwo, mutariire kantu. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:30">Mat 10:30</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikubeeshengyerereza kurya aha by'okurya; nibyo biraija kubaha amaani, kandi tiharikwija kugira kashokye na kamwe akaabura aha mitwe yaanyu mwena. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaakwata omugaati, yaasiima Ruhanga omu maisho ga boona, yaagubega, yaatandika kurya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Boona baiha aho baaguma emitima, baarya aha by'okurya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Twena abaabaire bari omu meeri tukaba turi abantu magana abiri na makumi mushanju na mukaaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ku baaherize kuhaaga, baanaga engano omu nyanja, ngu emeeri eyanguhirwe.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ku bwaseesire, tibaamanya nsi ei baareebire; kwonka baareeba omukono gw'enyanja oguriho enyambukiro y'omusheenyi, baahanuura kureeba yaaba nibabaasa kuhitsyayo emeeri. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Baacwaho ebitsibo, baabitsiga omu nyanya; ku baabaire nibakikora ebyo, baakomorora emirunga eyaabaire ekwatsire ebirikubogora emeeri; baahanika eitanga ery'omumaisho ngu babone kutwarwa omuyaga nibagyema enyambukiro. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kwonka ku baahikire ahu amaizi gaabugaabuganira, omutwe gw'emeeri gwashaaya, emeeri yaaguma aho, kandi ekibunu kyayo kyasheenyagurwa amaani g'ebingozi. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Abaserukare baacwa obwengye kwita embohe, ngu zitaziha, zikacwa; <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />kwonka omukuru waabo, ahabw'okwenda kukiza Paulo, yaabazibira kubaita; yaaragiira ngu, abakumanya kuziha beetuure omu nyanja, bazihe bahikye aha nkungu, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />kandi ngu abandi bagyendere aha mbaaho nari aha bicweka by'emeeri. Batyo boona baakira, baahika aha nkungu.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okurumwa empiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ku twaherize kukira, twabona kumanya ngu ekirwa ekyo nikyetwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:27">2 Kor 11:27</ref>. </char></note> Enzaarwa zaakyo zaatugirira embabazi ezitagirwa bantu boona; ahakuba zikatuhembera omuriro, zaatwakiira twena, ahabw'enjura eyaabaire neegwa, kandi hariho n'embeho. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo ku yaateeraine omuganda gw'enku, yaazita omu muriro; ahonaaho ahabw'ekibabo ky'omuriro haarugamu empiri, emuri aha mukono neereereeta. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Abazaarwa b'ekyo kirwa, ku baareebire egyo mpiri emwezingire aha mukono, baagambirana bati: Buzima omuntu ogu n'omwitsi; n'obu araabe yaakira enyanja, ruhanga otasingisiriza tayenzire ku agumaho. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:18">Mak 16:18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Paulo yaakunkumurira egyo mpiri omu muriro, tiyaagira ku yaaba. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:11">Byak 14:11</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija abo baateekateeka ngu naija kuzimba, nari shi agwe aho, afeereho; kwonka ku baamazire omwanya muhango bategyereize, baareeba hataine kabi akaamubaho, baahindura ebiteekateeko, baagira ngu, Ni ruhanga.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okutambira ishe w'Omukuru wa Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Haihi n'omwanya ogwo hakaba hariho emisiri y'omutegyeki mukuru w'ekirwa ekyo orikwetwa Pubulio, yaatwakiira, yaatukunira gye ebiro bishatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Kandi ishe wa Pubulio akaba arwaire omushwija n'esheshe. Paulo yaataaha omu nju ye, yaamushabira, yaamutaho engaro, yaamukiza. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ekyo ku kyakozirwe, n'abandi barwaire ab'omu kirwa ekyo baija, baatambirwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Baatuha ekitiinisa kingi; kandi ku twabaire niturugayo, baatureetera omu meeri ebi twabaire nitwetenga byona.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuhika Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ku hahingwireho ameezi ashatu, twarugayo omu meeri eya Alegizanderia, eyaamazire ebiro by'embeho omu kirwa ekyo, akamanyiso kaayo bari Baaruhanga b'Empasha. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Twahika Surakuusa, twamarayo kashatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Omukurugayo twayekiikuura, twahika Regio; ku haahingwireho ekiro kimwe, haija omuyaga gw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo; aha kiro kya kabiri twahika Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Okwo twashangayo ab'eishe-emwe, baatweshengyereza kumara nabo ebiro mushanju. Okwo nikwo twahikire Rooma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ab'eishe-emwe ab'omuri Rooma, ku baatuhuriire, baija, baatubugana aha Katare ka Apio, n'aha Maduuka Ashatu. Paulo, ku yaabareebire, yaasima Ruhanga, yaaguma omutima. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ku twataahire omuri Rooma, omukuru w'abaserukare yaamurikira embohe omukuru w'abaserukare abaabaire nibarinda Kaisaari; kwonka baikiriza Paulo kweraaza naarindwa omuserukare.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubuurira Abayudaaya ba Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro bishatu, yaayeta abakuru b'Abayudaaya; ku baateeraine hamwe, yaabagira ati: Beene waitu, nyowe n'obu ndaabe ntaine kibi eki naakozire aha ihanga ryaitu, nari okushobya emigyenzo ya baatatenkuriitwe, kwonka bakampayo aha Barooma ndi embohe, nibaanyiha Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Abarooma bo, ku baaherize kuntonganisa, baayenda kundekura, ahabw'okuba bakareeba ntaine rubanja rw'okuunyitsa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Bwanyima Abayudaaya ku baabyangire, naagyemwa kujurira ahari Kaisaari; kwonka ntaine ki ndikurega eihanga ryaitu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:6">Byak 26:6</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo nibyo mbatumiire ngu tureebane, tugaaniire; ahabw'okuba eki naatuzirwe, kandi ekimboheise omu rujegyere oru, n'amatsiko agu Abaisraeli batuura bategyereize. <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Nabo baamugarukamu bati: Itwe titukatungaga mabaruha agarikuruga Buyudaaya kutumanyisa ebyawe, kandi tihariho n'omwe omuri beene waitu oraizire aha, akatugambira enkuru mbi ahariiwe, n'obu kwakuba okukugambaho kubi. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:34">Luk 2:34</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ka tuhurire eki orikuteekateeka; ahakuba ekigombe eki nikijumwa hoonahoona.<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Baamuraganisa erindi izooba; baija baingi omu nju ei yaabaire acumbikiremu. Yaabashobororera okuruga omu kasheeshe okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, naabahamiza eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga, naateeraho, kubaikiririsa ebya Yesu, naiha omu Biragiro bya Musa n'omu bya Baanabi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Abamwe baikiriza ebi yaabagambira, abandi tibaabiikiriza. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ku baabire nibenda kurugayo bataikirizaine, Paulo yaayongyera kubagambira ekigambo kimwe ati: Ebi Omwoyo Orikwera yaagambiire baashwenkuriimwe omu kanwa ka nabi Isaaya, akabigamba gye ati:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gyenda aha b'eihanga eri, obagire oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Okuhurira kwo muryahurira, kwonka timurishoborokyerwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Okureeba kwo muryareeba, kwonka timuryetegyereza;<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ahakuba emitima y'abantu aba ehindukire ebitsire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">N'amatu gaabo nigahurira kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">N'amaisho gaabo bagahumiize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ngu batakaareebesa amaisho gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">N'okuhuriza amatu gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">N'okwetegyereza n'emitima yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">N'okuhinduka, ngu mbakize.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 67:2">Zab 67:2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:46">Byak 13:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe mumanye ngu oku kujuna kwa Ruhanga kukatwekyerwa Abanyamahanga; kandi bo baryakworobera. <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Ku yaagambire ebigambo ebyo, Abayudaaya baagyenda nibahakana munonga bonka na bonka.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bwanyima Paulo yaamarayo emyaka ebiri yoona, nayeihurira empiiha z'enju ei yaabaire naaraaramu; naayakiira boona abaabaire bamutaayaayira, <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />naabuurira eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga, naayegyesa ebya Mukama waitu Yesu n'obumanzi bwona, ataine orikumuzibira.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>